"Columbia Tools","3AH","Columbia 3″ Anglehead",285.99,"<p>The Columbia 3″ Angleheads are a tool we are especially proud of. They stand atop our overbuilt lineup of products with their beautiful looks and construction. But above all their beauty, in the corner is all that matters, and they do not disappoint. Whether you are running behind the Corner Roller or skimming on a Corner Box these tools deliver great corner. They run like they are on ice and leave a finish that is ready to paint.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Precision set carbide blades</li> <li>Highly durable stainless wings</li> <li>Comes with wheel kit installed and Allan key for easy removal</li> <li>Slide lock for easy and secure attachment</li> <li>Four sizes available – 2″, 2.5″, 3″ and 3.5″</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","3BBH","Columbia 36"" 180-Grip Bent Flat Box Handle",153.0,"<p>Columbia 36"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminates the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. The bent handle design adds necessary leverage in all situations, and truly excels on butt-joints and headers.&nbsp;</p> <p>Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns. Everything you want in a box handle. Bent handle ergonomics combined with a standard 3/4"" tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish with less effort.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Bent ergonomic design increases leverage and requires less effort to push</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>36"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle is ideal for wall work, butt joints, and ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","3BH","Columbia 36"" 180-Grip Flat Box Handle",127.21,"<p>The New 36"" Feather Weight 180º handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminate the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns.</p> <p>These handles feature strong billet aluminum design with black metal anodizing, and laser engraving. Everything you want in a box handle combined with a feather weight, large diameter (1 1/4"" diameter) tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Feather Weight - Lightest Box Handles Around</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Feather weight large diameter (1.25in) tube design for perfect balance and desired pressure point</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>36"" Feather Weight 180-Grip is ideal for wall work, tight areas, butt joints, and low ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","3CSF","Columbia 3"" Combo Flusher",120.69,"<p>Columbia Combo Flushers have redefined angle finishing. They are built from the best materials, but above all, they are each hand ground and checked on a granite plate for perfection. Each one comes with wheels and an allen key for those who prefer not to use them.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Precision hand ground and set</li> <li>4 designs: 2.5″, 3″, 3.5″ &amp; wide track</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
