"Columbia Tools","3WTSF","Columbia 3"" Standard Corner Flusher",75.12,"<p>Columbia Standard Corner Flushers have redefined angle finishing. They are built from the best materials, but above all, they are each hand ground and checked on a granite plate for perfection. Each one comes with wheels and an allen key for those who prefer not to use them.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Precision hand ground and set</li> <li>5 designs: 2.5″, 3″, 3.5″, 4″ and wide track</li> <li>Wheels come standard</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","42BBH","Columbia 42"" 180-Grip Bent Flat Box Handle",154.7,"<p>Columbia 42"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminates the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. The bent handle design adds necessary leverage in all situations, and truly excels on butt-joints and headers.&nbsp;</p> <p>Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns. Everything you want in a box handle. Bent handle ergonomics combined with a standard 3/4"" tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish with less effort.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Bent ergonomic design increases leverage and requires less effort to push</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>42"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle is ideal for wall work, tight areas, butt joints, and low ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","42BH","Columbia 42"" 180-Grip Flat Box Handle",128.92,"<p>The New 42"" Feather Weight 180º handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminate the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns.</p> <p>These handles feature strong billet aluminum design with black metal anodizing, and laser engraving. Everything you want in a box handle combined with a feather weight, large diameter (1 1/4"" diameter) tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Feather Weight - Lightest Box Handles Around</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Feather weight large diameter (1.25in) tube design for perfect balance and desired pressure point</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>42"" Feather Weight 180-Grip is ideal for all-around wall work, butt joints, and low ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","4BBH","Columbia 48"" 180-Grip Bent Flat Box Handle",156.41,"<p>Columbia 48"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminates the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. The bent handle design adds necessary leverage in all situations, and truly excels on butt-joints and headers.&nbsp;</p> <p>Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns. Everything you want in a box handle. Bent handle ergonomics combined with a standard 3/4"" tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish with less effort.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Bent ergonomic design increases leverage and requires less effort to push</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>48"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle is ideal for wall work, butt joints, and ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","4BH","Columbia 48"" 180-Grip Flat Box Handle",130.59,"<p>The New 48"" Feather Weight 180º handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminate the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns.</p> <p>These handles feature strong billet aluminum design with black metal anodizing, and laser engraving. Everything you want in a box handle combined with a feather weight, large diameter (1 1/4"" diameter) tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Feather Weight - Lightest Box Handles AroundClamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Feather weight large diameter (1.25in) tube design for perfect balance and desired pressure point</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>48"" Feather Weight 180-Grip is ideal for all-around wall work, butt joints, and ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","4DF","Columbia 4"" Direct Corner Flusher",87.44,"<p>Columbia Direct Corner Flushers have redefined angle finishing. They are built from the best materials, but above all, they are each hand ground and checked on a granite plate for perfection. Each one comes with wheels and an allen key for those who prefer not to use them.</p> <p>FEATURES:</p> <ul> <li>Precision hand ground and set</li> <li>5 designs: 2.5″, 3″, 3.5″, 4″ and wide track</li> <li>Wheels come standard</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
