"Columbia Tools","55FFB","Columbia 5.5"" Flat Finishing Box",252.99,"<p>Columbia offers the widest range of high quality Flat Boxes in the world. From our 5.5” specialty box to our 14” they are all star performers. Well-built and fine-tuned to offer great flat joints for years. We have been being told for years that our boxes are the smoothest finishing and easiest to push. We are very proud to get this feedback and will make sure that every Flat Box we make exceeds your expectations.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Available in 5.5″, 7″, 8″, 10″, 12″ and now 14″ sizes</li> <li>Manual sweeping grip for tight spaces when you cannot actuate the box handle (not on the 5.5″ box)</li> <li>Bead wheel protects axel from wear while running box on bead</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","5BBH","Columbia 60"" 180-Grip Bent Flat Box Handle",158.12,"<p>Columbia 60"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminates the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. The bent handle design adds necessary leverage in all situations, and truly excels on butt-joints and headers.&nbsp;</p> <p>Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns. Everything you want in a box handle. Bent handle ergonomics combined with a standard 3/4"" tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish with less effort.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Bent ergonomic design increases leverage and requires less effort to push</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>60"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle is ideal for butt joints, headers and ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","5BH","Columbia 60"" 180-Grip Flat Box Handle",132.32,"<p>The New 60"" Feather Weight 180º handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminate the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns.</p> <p>These handles feature strong billet aluminum design with black metal anodizing, and laser engraving. Everything you want in a box handle combined with a feather weight, large diameter (1 1/4"" diameter) tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Feather Weight - Lightest Box Handles AroundClamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Feather weight large diameter (1.25in) tube design for perfect balance and desired pressure point</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>60"" Feather Weight 180-Grip is ideal for headers, butt joints, and ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","6BBH","Columbia 72"" 180-Grip Bent Flat Box Handle",159.84,"<p>Columbia 72"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle allows for a full braking capability over the entire 180º angle span. Grips the axle with a tremendous amount of pressure to eliminates the possibility of slippage when dealing with difficult angle situations. As a result, this produces cleaner, quicker and more efficient application of joint compound. A very versatile design that provides the best possible braking at any angle. The bent handle design adds necessary leverage in all situations, and truly excels on butt-joints and headers.&nbsp;</p> <p>Extra strong billet aluminum design for years of rugged usage. Less moving parts mean less breakdowns. Everything you want in a box handle. Bent handle ergonomics combined with a standard 3/4"" tube - helps you achieve the perfect balance, and perfect finish with less effort.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Bent ergonomic design increases leverage and requires less effort to push</li> <li>Clamp style 180 brake is simple and more durable than pinch brakes</li> <li>Strong billet aluminum design with black anodizing, and laser engraving</li> <li>Additional braking, control, and range of motion versus competitor handles</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brand boxes (Excluding TapeWorm).</li> <li>72"" 180-Grip Bent Box Handle is ideal for butt joints, headers and high ceilings</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","6BH","Columbia 72"" 180-Grip Featherweight Flat Box Handle",134.04,"<p>Columbia 72"" 180-Grip Featherweight Flat Box Handle</p>"
"Columbia Tools","7CFB","Columbia 7″ Throttle Box",210.29,"<p>The 7″ Throttle Box is another great product of ours that offers years of great performance. All billet construction with a threaded stainless steel ball, this Corner Box looks and operates seamlessly. All our Corner Boxes now come standard with automatic capabilities, making pushing the box at least 50% easier than standard boxes. The new springs have adjustable tensions and greatly reduce the occurence of air pockets while running. The Throttle Box allows the corners to be quickly coated with your choice of angle head or applicator head. *Patent Pending</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Available in 7″ and 8″ sizes</li> <li>New spring tension allows for 50% easier push</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> <li>Patent Pending</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","7FFB","Columbia 7"" Flat Finishing Box",255.24,"<p>Columbia Taping Tools 7"" Hinged Drywall Flat Finisher Box&nbsp;features precision joint compound metering adjustment for top quality finish surfaces on drywall butt joints and flat seams. Integrated door axle and pressure plate system allows smooth, easy operation and quick access for easy cleanup! New, ultra-reliable door plate wiper resists expansion or deterioration, for long-term ease of operation and greater reliability.</p> <p>7"" Hinged Drywall Flat Finisher Box by Columbia Taping Tools has a new improved wiper on the pressure plate, combined with a smooth pivoting hinge axle, making this one of the easiest drywall flat finisher boxes to operate when finishing drywall butt joints and flat seams. 7"" Hinged Flat Box by Columbia Taping Tools is an excellent choice for base coating tape seams.</p>"
"Columbia Tools","8CFB","Columbia 8″ Throttle Box",227.37,"<p>The 8″ Throttle Box is another great product of ours that offers years of great performance. All billet construction with a threaded stainless steel ball, this Corner Box looks and operates seamlessly. All our Corner Boxes now come standard with automatic capabilities, making pushing the box at least 50% easier than standard boxes. The new springs have adjustable tensions and greatly reduce the occurence of air pockets while running. The Throttle Box allows the corners to be quickly coated with your choice of angle head or applicator head. *Patent Pending</p> <p>&nbsp;Features:</p> <ul> <li>Available in 7″ and 8″ sizes</li> <li>New spring tension allows for 50% easier push</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> <li>Patent Pending</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","8FBB","Columbia 8"" Fat Boy Flat Box",285.99,"<p>Columbia offers the widest range of high quality, high capacity finishing boxes in the world. From our 5.5″ Fat Boy to our 12″, they are all star performers. Well-built and fine-tuned to offer great flat joints for years. We have been told for years that our boxes are the smoothest finishing and easiest to push, and now they’re also the highest capacity on the market. We are very proud to get this feedback and will make sure that every Fat Boy box we make exceeds your expectations.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Available in 5.5″, 8″, 10″, 12″ sizes</li> <li>Bead wheel protects axel from wear while running box on bead</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","8FBBA","Columbia 8"" Fat Boy Automatic Assist Drywall Flat Box",313.52,"<p>Columbia offers the widest range of high quality Finishing Boxes in the world. The Automatic Flat Boxes reduce the need to push the compound on to the wall. By engaging, the box springs put pressure on the compound chamber requiring only a light push to operate the box. Well-built and fine-tuned to offer great flat joints for years. We have been told for years that our boxes are the smoothest finishing and easiest to push. We are very proud to get this feedback and will make sure that every Finishing Box we make exceeds your expectations.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Available in 8″, 10″, 12″ &amp; 14″ regular and 8″, 10″ &amp; 12″ Fat Boy sizes</li> <li>Engaging axel creates pressure on mud release</li> <li>Over 50% easier to push</li> <li>Great for vertical flats</li> <li>Bead wheel protects axel from wear while running box on bead</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","8FFB","Columbia 8"" Flat Finishing Box",256.12,"<p>Columbia Taping Tools 8"" Hinged Drywall Flat Finisher Box&nbsp;features precision joint compound metering adjustment for top quality finish surfaces on drywall butt joints and flat seams. Integrated door axle and pressure plate system allows smooth, easy operation and quick access for easy cleanup! New, ultra-reliable door plate wiper resists expansion or deterioration, for long-term ease of operation and greater reliability.</p> <p>8"" Hinged Drywall Flat Finisher Box by Columbia Taping Tools has a new improved wiper on the pressure plate, combined with a smooth pivoting hinge axle, making this one of the easiest drywall flat finisher boxes to operate when finishing drywall butt joints and flat seams. 8"" Hinged Flat Box by Columbia Taping Tools is an excellent choice for base coating tape seams.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Hinged pressure plate and quick release tabs for extremely easy cleanup!</li> <li>8"" Columbia Hinged Flat Box is excellent for applying base coat on drywall flat seams.</li> <li>""Commercial Grade"" pressure plate wiper resists expansion or corrosion for easy operation and long service life.</li> <li>Aluminum wheels with o-ring tires are long lasting and smooth running.</li> <li>Compatible with all leading brands of flat box handles (except Tapeworm)</li> <li>Can be operated with or without pressure plate springs</li> <li>Smooth operation without door springs is possible due to reduced drag of Integrated Pressure Door Axle.</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","8FFBA","Columbia 8"" Automatic Assist Drywall Flat Box",281.39,"<p>Columbia Taping Tools 8"" Automatic Assist Drywall Flat Finisher Box&nbsp;features precision joint compound metering adjustment for top quality finish surfaces on drywall butt joints and flat seams. Integrated door axle and pressure plate system allows smooth, easy operation and quick access for easy cleanup! New, ultra-reliable door plate wiper resists expansion or deterioration, for long-term ease of operation and greater reliability.</p> <p>8"" Automatic Assist Drywall Flat Finisher Box by Columbia Taping Tools has a new and improved spring pressure assist that requires far less manual pushing to dispense compound. Save time and reduce fatigue by letting the tool do more of the work.</p> <p>Spring assisted with an improved wiper on the pressure plate, combined with a smooth pivoting hinge axle, making this one of the easiest drywall flat finisher boxes to operate. Columbia features a handy finger pull on the pressure door that makes fill-ups quicker and easier</p>"
"Columbia Tools","8ITFB","Columbia 8"" Inside Track Fat Boy Flat Box",285.99,"<p>High capacity Inside Track FatBoy box holds 30% more mud compound than standard flat box, for less trips back to the loading pump. Compatible with all leading brands of drywall flat box finisher brake handles, and quick clean feature allows convenient access to clean without removing pressure plate. 8"" box is excellent for applying the base coat of mud to drywall flat seams and is super effective when finishing butt joints.</p> <p>Columbia Inside Track Fat Boy boxes can be run with or without springs, due to combined axle and door plate design. ""Commercial Grade"" rubber wiper resists corrosion or expansion for long, reliable service life. Columbia Fat Boys are extremely popular high capacity, top performance drywall flat finishers, and are a great choice for professional drywallers or contractors who prefer the high volume style.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Columbia 8"" Inside Track Fat Boy box is excellent for first coats on drywall flat seams and butt joints.</li> <li>Quick, easy cleanup is possible without disassembly- no more disconnected door plates to re-position after cleaning!</li> <li>Operate smoothly with or without springs, due to new combined pivot axle and door plate design.</li> <li>Wheels mounted inside side plates makes butt joint finishing easier</li> <li>Perfect for the Premier/Blue user looking for a box with better quality and a similar feel</li> <li>Increase production and profits due additional 30% capacity for fewer trips to the pump for refilling.</li> <li>Top quality anodized finish aluminum avoids corrosion and increases reliable service time.</li> <li>Fits all leading drywall flat finisher box handles.</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","91CGMT","Columbia Stainless Steel 9 in 1 Comfort Grip Multi Tool",8.25,"<p>The Columbia 9-in-1 Comfort Grip Multi-Tool combines multiple essential jobsite functions into one durable, professional-grade hand tool. Designed for drywall finishers, painters, contractors, and remodelers, this versatile tool helps reduce the number of separate tools needed for everyday scraping, patching, opening, cleaning, and surface-preparation tasks.</p> <p>Its high-quality stainless-steel blade provides the strength, flexibility, and corrosion resistance required for demanding professional use. The multi-function blade design allows the tool to handle a wide range of common jobsite applications while maintaining the smooth performance expected from Columbia finishing tools.</p> <p>A rubberized Comfort Grip handle provides a secure, controlled hold and helps reduce hand fatigue during extended use. Whether applying patching compound, scraping loose material, cleaning rollers, or completing general repair work, the Columbia 9-in-1 Multi-Tool delivers dependable performance in a convenient, easy-to-carry design.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Nine jobsite functions combined into one versatile hand tool</li> <li>High-quality stainless-steel blade provides strength and durability</li> <li>Corrosion-resistant construction supports long-lasting professional use</li> <li>Smooth blade flexibility offers improved control during scraping and spreading</li> <li>Rubberized Comfort Grip handle provides a secure, comfortable hold</li> <li>Helps reduce hand fatigue during extended use</li> <li>Ideal for scraping, patching, spreading, cleaning, opening, and surface preparation</li> <li>Compact design fits easily into tool belts, pouches, and toolboxes</li> <li>Built for drywall finishers, painters, contractors, and remodelers</li> </ul>"
