"Columbia Tools","AHA","Columbia Anglehead Adaptor",14.56,"<p>The Anglehead Adaptor is used on the Columbia One Handle System to seamlessly adjust from Corner Roller and Nailspotter to Anglehead! The AHA is purchased separately.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Works seamlessly with the Columbia One Handle System</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","BF","Columbia Box Filler",41.82,"<p>Available for both our regular and Tallboy pumps, these aluminum and stainless steel attachments are tough and effective. The Box Filler makes filling your Flat Boxes, Nail Spotters and Corner Boxes a dream.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Attaches to either Columbia Mud Pump to fill boxes</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
