"Columbia Tools","CPFP","Columbia X Graco PowerFill 3.5 Loading Pump",990.71,"<p data-ogsb=""white""><span data-ogsc=""black"">Columbia Tools has partnered with Graco to bring you a Columbia Tools branded version of their already successful cordless powered loading pump for Columbia customers. The Columbia X Graco PowerFill is designed to fill all automatic taping and finishing tools with ease. The PowerFill system completely eliminates the need for manual pumping, allowing you to fill with just the push of a button.</span></p> <p data-ogsb=""white""><span data-ogsc=""black"">Say Goodbye to Hand Pumping. The single-button pumping mechanism reduces fatigue and minimizes the risk of injury associated with manual pumps. With a flow rate of up to 3.5 gpm, you can fill tools lightning-fast, and with the capability to pump up to 55 gallons on a single battery charge, you’ll have all-day performance. Plus, it’s programmable to automatically refill tools with Precision Fill.</span></p> <p data-ogsb=""white""><span data-ogsc=""black"">Bucket not included.</span></p> <p data-ogsb=""white""><strong><span data-ogsc=""black"">Features</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">SmartControl Pro with Programmable Precision Fill: Automatically refills your tools to your preset level.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">One Button Pumping: Eliminates fatigue and potential injuries.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Hands-Free Continuous Run Mode: Ideal for transferring large quantities of material or self-cleaning.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Hi-Rise Fill Tube: Allows you to fill tools while standing upright, protecting your back and reducing fatigue. The tube rotates to position the outlet where needed, including above buckets to save space and contain drips.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Includes Filler Attachments: Designed for angle and flat boxes.</li> </ul> <p data-ogsb=""white""><strong><span data-ogsc=""black"">Powerstroke Pump</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">4X Life vs. Manual Pumps: Built for exceptional durability.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Fastest Tool Fills: Pumps up to 3.5 gpm for efficient filling.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Maintenance Free: Tool-less access for easy cleaning of the pump cylinder, inlet, and filter.</li> </ul> <p data-ogsb=""white""><strong><span data-ogsc=""black"">ProConnect Pump and Removable Powerhead</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">No-Tools Pump and Powerhead Removal: Easily detach the powerhead for storage and quick cleaning.</li> </ul> <p data-ogsb=""white""><strong><span data-ogsc=""black"">Powered by DEWALT®</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Compatible with any 20V MAX Lithium-Ion DEWALT Battery: Pumps up to 55 gallons per charge for reliable all-day use.</li> </ul> <p data-ogsb=""white""><strong><span data-ogsc=""black"">Adjustable Bucket Stabilizer</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">No-Tools Adjustment: Fits most buckets and containers.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Oversized Foot Bracket and Stabilizer Arm: Keeps the pump secure and stable.</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Convertible Outlet: Change from right to left-sided pump outlet in minutes</li> </ul> <p data-ogsb=""white""><strong><span data-ogsc=""black"">Specifications</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Version: 26B418</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Max GPM (lpm): 3.5 (13.2)</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Weight Lbs (Kg): 17 (7.7)</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Pump: PowerStroke</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Power/Battery: (1) DEWALT 20V MAX* COMPACT 2.0 ah Lithium-Ion Batteries and (1) Charger</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Pump Outlet: Hi-Rise Fill Tube w/Box Filler</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Precision Fill: Yes</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Inlet Filter: Tool-less, 10 Mesh (1)</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Adjustable Flow: Yes</li> <li data-ogsc=""black"" data-ogsb=""white"">Fits Container: Adjustable up to 5 (7-15″ Bucket Height Range)</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","CR","Columbia Inside Corner Roller",104.43,"<p>Our Inside Corner Roller offers the easiest roll in the industry. With our split wheel design tapes do not drag upon initial contact. The tape immediately imbeds in the corner with all unneeded compound being pushed out from behind.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Innovative split wheel design</li> <li>Cast aluminum body</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
