"Columbia Tools","FMH","Columbia L-Trim Mud Applicator Head",60.09,"<p>Proportionate grooves give you a consistent mud distribution on the wall and speeds up the pre-filling process. Made out of UHMW, the strong durable design makes these Mud Heads the best on the market.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Quick release clip</li> <li>Channeled grooves for evenly dispersed mud and controlled flow</li> <li>Long lasting, durable and strong</li> <li>Machined using top quality Ultra High Molecular Weight materials</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","GN","Columbia Gooseneck",68.28,"<p>Available in our regular and Tallboy, these stainless steel attachments are tough and effective. Rubber covers on the horseshoe protect your taper while being filled.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Tig welded stainless steel</li> <li>Rubber coated horseshoe</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","HMP","Columbia Mud Pump (Top Disconnect)",277.45,"<p>What a workhorse this tool is. Built to perform in the toughest environment, our pump smoothly and quickly fills your tools. With a 20 degree angle, the handle acts as a lever and keeps the operator from having to reach as far as other models on the market.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>20 degree angled handle makes pumping easier and more comfortable</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","IA90","Columbia 90 Inside Plastic Applicator",60.09,"<p>Proportionate grooves give you a consistent mud distribution on the 90 degree inside angle and speeds up the pre-filling process. Made out of UHMW, the strong durable design makes these Mud Heads the best on the market.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Available in Inside 90° angle</li> <li>Quick release clip</li> <li>Channeled grooves for evenly dispersed mud and controlled flow</li> <li>Long lasting, durable and strong</li> <li>Machined using top quality Ultra High Molecular Weight materials</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","ICA21","Columbia 2 Wheel Inside Corner Applicator",39.41,"<p>Columbia Inside Corner Applicators are all machined from solid aluminum billet. They are very accurate and their Delrin wheels glide along the wall. Offered in two and four wheel designs.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>The one way model is offered with two wheels or four wheels</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","ICA41","Columbia 4 Wheel Inside Corner Applicator",50.51,"<p>Columbia Inside Corner Applicators are all machined from solid aluminum billet. They are very accurate and their Delrin wheels glide along the wall. Offered in two and four wheel designs.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>The one way model is offered with two wheels or four wheels</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","ICATW","Columbia Two Way Internal Corner Applicator",66.51,"<p>Columbia Two Way Internal Corner Applicators are all machined from solid aluminum billet. They are very accurate and their Delrin wheels glide along the wall.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Hand made from U.S. aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","MH","Columbia Matrix Extendable Flat Box Handle",232.76,"<p>The Columbia Matrix Flat Box Handle is lightweight and all mechanical. With a 90 degree grip, the Matrix gives you increased control over your box. These handles are durable and extremely long lasting, all while maintaining the comfort and ease of use that you’re used to with the Columbia brand of tools. The Columbia Matrix mechanical flat box handle is made of all billet aluminum, ensuring a long life.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Now available in 3 sizes!</li> <li>Fully mechanical brake</li> <li>90 degree grip allows for better control over the box</li> <li>First Flat Box Handle handmade solely from U.S. billet aluminum</li> <li>Sizes extend: 29″ to 39″ (MHS), 40″ to 60″ (MH), and 56″ to 76″ (MHL)</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> <li>Ergonomic handle grip for easy brake pressure</li> <li>Fits all Flat Box brands</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","MH17","Columbia Matrix Pinch Brake",10.77,"<p>Columbia Matrix Pinch Brake</p>"
"Columbia Tools","MH21","Columbia Matrix Grip Adjuster Housing",4.4,"<p>Columbia Matrix Grip Adjuster Housing</p>"
