"Columbia Tools","PTAPER","Columbia Predator Carbon Fiber Automatic Taper",1458.91,"<p>The Predator is the world’s first Carbon Fiber Taper and the benefits that come with this are endless. The Columbia Taper is a precision built tool that has been perfected over 38 years, but now it is also significantly lighter than all other tapers on the market and dent proof. This tool will tape flats and angles effortlessly year after year. From less drag in the corners to our easy to remove cap for cleaning, this tool will not let you down. Stainless steel side plates and cable drum and creaser arms offer a lifetime of corrosion resistance. The Patent Pending Pump Action cutting sleeve gives the operator a smoother glide over teflon bearings, superb grip and the pull ring is great for higher ceilings. The Predator maintains it’s stable temperature and remains warm to the touch. Every taper comes standard with an adjustable brake and quick release for tape changing. The Titanium pull rod is just another detail that adds style and edge to this innovative, unique taper. If you are serious about taping and care how a taper feels and performs this is the one for you.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Handmade from Carbon Fiber and steel components</li> <li>Titanium pull rod</li> <li>Adjustable Brake</li> <li>Quick release for tape changing</li> <li>Reduced Drag system for corners</li> <li>Stainless steel side plates, creaser arms and cable drum</li> <li>Quick release cap</li> <li>NEW Very smooth Patent Pending Pump Action cutting system with a roller chain</li> <li>53″ in length</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art factory in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","PTS","Columbia Predator Tactical Set",4052.14,"<p>The NEW Predator Tactical Set makes moving to Automatic Taping Tools easy and includes the upgrade of the Columbia Predator Carbon Fibre Automatic Taper! Every taping tool you will need to completely finish a house comes packaged inside our durable, rugged Road Case. This set takes the guess work out of choosing the perfect drywall taping tools kit.</p> <p>Set Includes:</p> <ul> <li>Road Case</li> <li>Predator Automatic Taper</li> <li>10″ Flat Box</li> <li>12″ Flat Box</li> <li>Matrix Handle</li> <li>7″ Tomahawk</li> <li>24″ Tomahawk</li> <li>8″ Throttle Box</li> <li>3″ Anglehead</li> <li>Hot Mud Pump</li> <li>Box Filler &amp; Gooseneck</li> <li>Corner Roller</li> <li>AHA</li> <li>3″ Nail Spotter</li> <li>Columbia One Handle and Columbia One EXT</li> <li>Sander Head</li> <li>Twist Lock Handle</li> <li>Tomalock Adapter</li> <li>Repair Kits: AH-RK, FFBR9-10, FFBR9-12, FFBR7-7A, CTR-1</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","RC","Columbia Road Case",658.08,"<p>The highly requested Columbia Road Case has an extremely durable design to protect your tools on the job. Built to take the abuses of travel, and wear and tear from job sites, the Road Case comes equipped with rubber feet, rolling wheels and ergonomic handles. This case will hold a full set of Columbia tools, including a pump!</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Most durable tool case on the market</li> <li>Rolling wheels</li> <li>Ergonomical handles on front and side for easy carrying and rolling</li> <li>Rubber feet on bottom for protection and easy grip</li> <li>Latches have locking capabilities</li> <li>Measurements: 17”x9”x57”</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","SACS","Columbia Semi Automatic Commando Set",718.35,"<p>The NEW Commando Set from Columbia Tools takes the guess work out of moving over to Semi-Automatic Drywall Tools. This set is a great introduction to Semi-Auto tools for the part-time finisher, or someone who is looking to make the leap to Automatic tools but doesn’t want to jump right in yet. This set will save you time and give you a great finish. The Commando set comes with all the essentials in the Semi-Auto line, as well as a convenient case to store, and keep safe, your new Columbia Tools.</p> <p>Set Includes:</p> <ul> <li>Semi-Automatic Case</li> <li>2.5″ Standard Flusher (2.5SF)</li> <li>3″ Standard Flusher (3SF)</li> <li>42″ Compound Mud Tube (CMT42)</li> <li>Columbia One Extendible Handle – 3′-5′ – (C1HEXT)</li> <li>Columbia One Fixed Handle (C1H)</li> <li>Angle Head Adapter (AHA)</li> <li>Flat Applicator Head (CFLT)</li> <li>Two-Way Internal Applicator (ICATW)</li> <li>Corner Roller Head (CR)</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","SAT","Columbia Semi Automatic Taper",166.26,"<p>The Semi-Automatic Taper or “Bucket Taper” allows users to apply a specific amount of compound to a large volume of tape. It has a tape spool with brake to cut down on operator fatigue. Columbia’s semi automatic taper is easy to use, durable and has laser engraved instruction on the door.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Tape spool with brake to control tape dispensing</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","SB212","Columbia Replacement 12"" Blade for Tomahawk",19.09,"<p>Columbia Replacement 12"" Blade for Tomahawk</p>"
"Columbia Tools","SB214","Columbia Replacement 14"" Blade for Tomahawk",23.35,"<p>Columbia Replacement 14"" Blade for Tomahawk</p>"
"Columbia Tools","SB218","Columbia Replacement 18"" Blade for Tomahawk",27.59,"<p>Columbia Replacement 18"" Blade for Tomahawk</p>"
"Columbia Tools","SB224","Columbia Replacement 24"" Blade for Tomahawk",31.83,"<p>Columbia Replacement 24"" Blade for Tomahawk</p>"
"Columbia Tools","SB232","Columbia Replacement 32"" Blade for Tomahawk",36.07,"<p>Columbia Replacement 32"" Blade for Tomahawk</p>"
"Columbia Tools","SB27","Columbia Replacement 7"" Blade for Tomahawk",10.61,"<p>Columbia Replacement 7"" Blade for Tomahawk</p>"
"Columbia Tools","SBSET","Columbia Sabre Set",239.99,"<p>The New Columbia Sabre set takes the guess work out of starting off with Smoothing Blades. Just like the Tomahawk Warrior set, this set contains a variety of sizes that will help you complete most every smoothing blade job. From wiping down tapes, to fully coating walls and ceilings, and everything in between, this kit will have you covered.</p> <p>The Sabre Set comes with the Sabre essentials, as well as a convenient case to protect your investment. The case also makes it easy to get your set onto the job site. Columbia Sabre Smoothing Blades make easy work out of sanding and finishing.</p> <h4>SET INCLUDES:</h4> <ul> <li>Sabre Case</li> <li>10″ Sabre</li> <li>16″ Sabre</li> <li>24″ Sabre</li> <li>32″ Sabre</li> <li>Sabre Claw Adaptor</li> <li>Sabre Pole</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","SPTAPER","Columbia Sawed Off Mini PREDATOR Automatic Taper",1458.91,"<p>Columbia Taping Tools introduces the world's first Mini Carbon Fiber Taper, The Predator ""Sawed Off"" Mini. Unlike other taper bodies made mostly from aluminum, the Predator's Carbon Fiber construction, makes this precision-engineered tool&nbsp;20% lighter&nbsp;and more durable then any standard mini taper on the market. Another unique benefit of this Dent Proof construction, is that Carbon Fiber maintains temperature stability, meaning this taper will remain warm to the touch. The 6 wheel cutting sleeve has been updated in favor of teflon sliders which gives the operator a smoother glide and better grip. Now, changing the sliders out is simple field maintenance and can be installed with a standard screwdriver in minutes as opposed to half an hour or more. The pull ring is ideal for higher ceilings. The Predator will tape flats and angles effortlessly with less drag in the corners. The quick release cap makes cleaning a breeze and the stainless steel side plates, cable drum, and creaser arms offer a lifetime of corrosion resistance. With style, functionality, and durability the Predator from Columbia takes the -Evolution of Taping- to a whole new level. Predator ""Sawed Off"" Mini is perfect for taping drywall in small rooms and closets when a full size taper is too cumbersome.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Handmade From Carbon Fiber and Steel Components.</li> <li>Titanium Pull Rod.</li> <li>Adjustable Brake.</li> <li>Quick Release For Easy Tape Changing.</li> <li>Zero Drag System For Corners.</li> <li>Knurled Sleeve With Pull Ring.</li> <li>Stainless Steel Side Plates, Creaser Arms And Cable Drum.</li> <li>Quick Release Cap.</li> <li>NEW Patent Pending Pump Action Sleeve Offers Smoother Cut.</li> <li>Machined In Columbia's State Of The Art Factory In Canada.</li> <li>Measures 42"" in Length Compared To 52"" Of Full-Size Taper.</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","STAPER","Columbia Sawed Off Mini Automatic Taper",1166.49,"<p>The Columbia Automatic Taper is a precision built tool that is back by popular demand. This tool will tape flats and angles effortlessly year after year. From less drag in the corners to any easy to remove cap for cleaning, this tool will not let you down. A hard anodized tube eliminates the track lines that occur on so many other tools. Stainless steel side plates and cable drum and creaser arms offer a lifetime of corrosion resistance. Every taper comes standard with an adjustable brake and quick release for tape changing. At 39″, this taper is perfect for tight spaces such as stairwells, closets, scaffold and low ceilings. If you are serious about taping and care how a taper feels and performs this is the one for you.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>39″ compared to a regular taper at 53″</li> <li>Holds a 500ft roll of standard tape</li> <li>Handmade from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> <li>Now with NEW Pump Action Sleeve – smoothest cutting sleeve on the market</li> <li>Adjustable Brake</li> <li>Quick release for tape changing</li> <li>Zero Drag system for corners</li> <li>Hard anodized tube</li> <li>Stainless steel side plates, creaser arms and cable drum</li> <li>Quick release cap</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TAPER","Columbia Automatic Taper",1166.49,"<p>The Columbia Automatic Taper is a precision built tool that has been perfected over 40 years. This tool will tape flats and angles effortlessly year after year. From less drag in the corners to any easy to remove cap for cleaning, this tool will not let you down. A hard anodized tube eliminates the track lines that occur on so many other tools. Stainless steel side plates and cable drum and creaser arms offer a lifetime of corrosion resistance. The NEW Patent Pending Pump Action Sleeve gives the operator the smoothest cut on the market and the pull ring is great for higher ceilings. Every taper comes standard with an adjustable brake and quick release for tape changing. If you are serious about taping and care how a taper feels and performs this is the one for you.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Handmade from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> <li>Now with NEW Pump Action Sleeve – smoothest cutting sleeve on the market</li> <li>Adjustable Brake</li> <li>Quick release for tape changing</li> <li>Zero Drag system for corners</li> <li>Hard anodized tube</li> <li>Stainless steel side plates, creaser arms and cable drum</li> <li>Quick release cap</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TBBF","Columbia Tall Boy Box Filler",41.82,"<p>Available for both our regular and Tallboy pumps, these aluminum and stainless steel attachments are tough and effective. The Box Filler makes filling your Flat Boxes, Nail Spotters and Corner Boxes a dream.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Attaches to either Columbia Mud Pump to fill boxes</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TBGN","Columbia Tall Boy Gooseneck",99.0,"<p>Available in our regular and Tallboy, these stainless steel attachments are tough and effective. Rubber covers on the horseshoe protect your taper while being filled.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Tig welded stainless steel</li> <li>Rubber coated horseshoe</li> <li>Hand made from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TBMP","Columbia Tall Boy Mud Pump",367.22,"<p>We are very proud to offer this tool. After using it, people agree they would never go back to the standard pump again. The Tallboy is a mud pump that will allow you to stand upright while filling your tools. The extra height also allows for use in a 30 gallon pale for those who want to cut down on mixing time.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Ergonomically superior</li> <li>20 degree angled handle makes pumping easier and more comfortable</li> <li>User can see when taper is full when using goose neck</li> <li>Saves physical stress and energy</li> <li>Moveable bracket to fit all 5 gallon pails</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TBPTAPER","Columbia Tall Boy Predator Automatic Taper",1561.91,"<p>Our Carbon Fiber Predator Automatic Taper is one of the latest innovations out of the Columbia workshop. The first carbon fiber taper on the market, the Predator is also the lightest and most durable. We are proud to offer our customers the next generation in top notch drywall taping tools.&nbsp;</p>"
"Columbia Tools","TCS","Columbia Semi Automatic Tool Case",138.38,"<p>Lightweight, but extremely durable, Columbia’s Semi-Automatic case can accommodate a complete semi-automatic set of tools. With the egg-shell foam inside, the case secures the tools in place when it is latched closed. The Semi-Automatic case is also useful for storage of the Columbia Tomahawk Smoothing Blades (up to 40″). Not intended for automatic tools.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Fits a full set of Columbia Semi Automatic Tools</li> <li>Eggshell foam for support</li> <li>4 lock latches</li> <li>Combination of piano-style and brass hinges for storage safety when locked</li> <li>Measurements: 53.4″ x 16.5″ x 4.5″</li> <li>Made in North America</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TL38","Columbia Twist Lock Extendable Handle 3' - 8'",56.68,"<p>Our popular Twist Lock Handle is a three stage pole with a brass thread that allows users to easily adjust where the seam falls, creating a more comfortable grip. This handle extends from 3′ to 8′ and is used with the Nail Spotters, all Rollers and the Angle Head Adaptor.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>This handle extends 3′ -8′</li> <li>Handmade from U.S. billet aluminum and steel components</li> <li>Machined in our state of the art facility in Canada</li> <li>Hard anodized tube</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TS","Columbia Tactical Set",3759.73,"<p>The NEW Tactical Set makes moving to Automatic Taping Tools easy! Every taping tool you will need to completely finish a house comes packaged inside our durable, rugged Road Case. This set takes the guess work out of choosing the perfect drywall taping tools kit.</p> <p>SET INCLUDES:</p> <ul> <li>Road Case</li> <li>Automatic Taper</li> <li>10″ Flat Box</li> <li>12″ Flat Box</li> <li>Matrix Handle</li> <li>7″ Tomahawk</li> <li>24″ Tomahawk</li> <li>8″ Throttle Box</li> <li>3″ Anglehead</li> <li>Hot Mud Pump</li> <li>Box Filler &amp; Gooseneck</li> <li>Corner Roller</li> <li>AHA</li> <li>3″ Nail Spotter</li> <li>Columbia One Handle and Columbia One EXT</li> <li>Sander Head</li> <li>Twist Lock Handle</li> <li>Tomalock Adapter</li> <li>Repair Kits: AH-RK, FFBR9-10, FFBR9-12, FFBR7-7A, CTR-1</li> </ul>"
"Columbia Tools","TWS","Columbia Tomahawk Warrior Set",432.16,"<p>The New Columbia Warrior set takes the guess work out of starting off with Smoothing Blades. This set contains a variety of sizes that will help you complete most every smoothing blade job. From wiping down tapes, to fully coating walls and ceilings, and everything in between, this kit will have you covered.<br>The Warrior Set comes with the Tomahawk essentials, as well as a convenient case to protect your investment. The case also makes it easy to get your set onto the job site. Columbia Tomahawk Smoothing Blades make easy work out of sanding and finishing.</p> <p>SET INCLUDES:</p> <ul> <li>Gun Case</li> <li>7″ Tomahawk</li> <li>12″ Tomahawk</li> <li>18″ Tomahawk</li> <li>32″ Tomahawk</li> <li>Tomalock Adaptor</li> <li>Columbia One EXT Handle</li> </ul>"
