"TapeTech","15TTEWOH","TapeTech Inside Corner Roller w/o Handle",130.85,"<p>The TapeTech Inside Corner Roller quickly and accurately embeds the tape firmly into the internal corners of the drywall. Use the corner roller immediately after applying joint tape to the internal corner with the automatic taper. The corner roller forces excess joint compound out from behind the tape in preparation for the corner finisher. The TapeTech Corner Roller features stainless steel rollers for crisp edges and long life.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Embeds tape into compound at inside corners of walls and ceilings</li> <li>Forces excess joint compound out of corner in preparation for corner finisher/flusher to smooth</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","16TT","16TT Mud Head",59.8,"<p><strong>Operation</strong></p> <p>The Mud Head is designed to place a consistently wide ribbon of joint compound to each side of the internal or external corner for installation of paper tape or corner bead. Snap the Mud Head onto the corner applicator or MudRunner® and fill it with joint compound. Start at one end of the corner and apply pressure to the corner applicator or MudRunner™ to start the flow of compound while moving the tool along the corner to the opposite end. Now apply the tape or corner bead.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Maintenance</strong></p> <p>Clean thoroughly with brush and water (or water hose) to remove all joint compound from the tool. After the tool is clean, lightly oil with Ames® Bazooka® Oil or any light machine oil.</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/gmscom/master/media-common/tswfast/content/16TT_schematic.pdf"">16TT Schematic</a></p>"
"TapeTech","16TT90","Mud Head 90 Degree Inside Corner Finisher",59.8,"<p>Mud heads apply a base coat of compound prior to installation of corner bead and make installing corner bead simpler and cleaner than ever.&nbsp;</p><p><b><u>Features:&nbsp;</u></b></p><ul><li>EasyClean design&nbsp;</li><li>Works with nearly all shapes of corner bead&nbsp;</li><li>Handles are sold separately and are required for use</li></ul>"
"TapeTech","179009","Nyliner Type 6",1.01,"Nyliner Type 6"
"TapeTech","17TT","TapeTech Outside Corner Roller",113.32,"<p>The TapeTech Outside Corner Roller firmly embeds paper-faced corner bead on external drywall corners and removes the excess joint compound from beneath it. The nylon rollers provide a smooth surface to prevent damage to the corner bead.&nbsp;Use with the FHTT Fiberglass Handle or the XHTT Extension Handle – not included.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Embeds paper faced outside corner bead into compound or adhesive</li> <li>Easy clean design</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","17TTE","TapeTech 17TTE Outside Corner Roller",128.84,"<p>TapeTech 17TTE Outside Corner Roller</p>"
