"TapeTech","40XTT","TapeTech 2"" Angle Head Drywall Corner Finisher - 40XTT",262.5,"<ul> <li>TapeTech 2"" Angle Head Drywall Corner Finisher</li> <li>The corner finisher is designed to wipe down and feather both sides of an internal corner in one pass.</li> <li>Used to follow the Corner Roller and wipe down excess compound left when the tape is embedded into the corner. The spring action compensates for corners that are slightly over or under 90 degrees and the blade design produces smoothly feathered internal corners.</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","411003","Tape Tech Part 411003",19.65,"<p>Part for 4"" Corner Flusher</p> <p>Tape Tech Part #411003</p> <p>&nbsp;</p>"
"TapeTech","420009","Blade, Carbide, 2.5""",10.95,"Blade, Carbide, 2.5"""
"TapeTech","42TT","2 1/2 in TapeTech 42TT Corner Finisher",271.0,"<p>The TapeTech Corner Finisher is used to perfectly feather both joint compound edges of internal corners in one pass. The Corner Finishers can be used for wall-to-wall internal corners or wall-to-ceiling corners. Corner Finishers, also referred to as Angle Finishers, are attached to a corner applicator (CA07TT or CA08TT) or the 14TT MudRunner® to quickly and professionally finish internal drywall corners. TapeTech Corner Finishers are spring loaded to help compensate for slightly imperfect corners. Use with the FHTT Fiberglass Handle or the XHTT Extension Handle – not included.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Wipes down excess mud in internal corners</li> <li>Embeds inside corner tape on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Finishes inside corners of walls and ceilings</li> <li>Stainless steel frames</li> <li>Patented, positive ball retainer</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","450005","Blade Tension Spring",7.17,"<p>Replacement blade tension spring for TapeTech 45TT 3 inch Corner Finisher</p>"
"TapeTech","450005","Blade Tension Spring",7.17,"<p>Replacement blade tension spring for TapeTech 45TT 3 inch Corner Finisher</p>"
