"TapeTech","8134TT","34"" EasyFinish Box Handle",181.83,"<p>The TapeTech EasyFinish® Box Handles attach to the TapeTech EasyClean™, EasyClean™ High Capacity or Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes and provide control to cleanly sweep the boxes off the joint for a perfect finish. They incorporate an ergonomic, bent handle design for increased leverage and less effort. The EasyFinish® handles are highly recommended for use with the TapeTech Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes as the bent handle helps to activate the Power Assist™ mechanism.</p> <ul> <li>The best type of handle to use with Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes</li> <li>Great for use on overhead work</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ Boxes</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ High Capacity Boxes</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","8142TT","42 in TapeTech EasyFinish Box Handle",187.11,"<p>The TapeTech EasyFinish® Box Handles attach to the TapeTech EasyClean™, EasyClean™ High Capacity or Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes and provide control to cleanly sweep the boxes off the joint for a perfect finish. They incorporate an ergonomic, bent handle design for increased leverage and less effort. The EasyFinish® handles are highly recommended for use with the TapeTech Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes as the bent handle helps to activate the Power Assist™ mechanism.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>The best type of handle to use with Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes</li> <li>Easier to use on overhead work</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ Boxes</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech MAXXBOX®</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ High Capacity Boxes</li> <li>Ergonomic bent handle design</li> <li>Anodized aluminum handle</li> <li>Adjustable grip</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","8154TT","54"" EasyFinish Box Handle",191.29,"<p>The TapeTech EasyFinish® Box Handles attach to the TapeTech EasyClean™, EasyClean™ High Capacity or Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes and provide control to cleanly sweep the boxes off the joint for a perfect finish. They incorporate an ergonomic, bent handle design for increased leverage and less effort. The EasyFinish® handles are highly recommended for use with the TapeTech Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes as the bent handle helps to activate the Power Assist™ mechanism.</p> <ul> <li>The best type of handle to use with Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes</li> <li>Easier to use on overhead work</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ Boxes</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ High Capacity Boxes</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","8172TT","72"" Easyfinish Bent Box Handle",203.89,"<p>The TapeTech EasyFinish® Box Handles attach to the TapeTech EasyClean™, EasyClean™ High Capacity or Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes and provide control to cleanly sweep the boxes off the joint for a perfect finish. They incorporate an ergonomic, bent handle design for increased leverage and less effort. The EasyFinish® handles are highly recommended for use with the TapeTech Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes as the bent handle helps to activate the Power Assist™ mechanism.</p> <ul> <li>The best type of handle to use with Power Assist™ Finishing Boxes</li> <li>Easier to use on overhead work</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ Boxes</li> <li>Attaches to TapeTech EasyClean™ High Capacity Boxes</li> </ul>"
