"TapeTech","857355","Gooseneck Cleaning Brush",32.34,"<p>Specifically designed to keep the gooseneck clean for optimal operation, this brush is the ideal stiffness to effectively remove the compound while the shaft has the flexibility to navigate the challenging shape of the gooseneck adapter.</p>"
