"TapeTech","88TTE","41 in - 63 in TapeTech XTender Finishing Box Handle",259.39,"<p>The TapeTech XTender® Finishing Box Handle attaches to the EasyClean®, EasyClean® High Capacity or Power Assist® Finishing Boxes and provides control to cleanly sweep the boxes off the joint for a perfect finish. The XTender® is the strongest extendable finishing box handle in the industry and adjusts from 41"" to 63"" for increased reach and versatility.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Extends for greater reach with all TapeTech finishing boxes</li> <li>Anodized aluminum construction</li> <li>Extends from 41"" to 63""</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","90TT","TapeTech Filler Adapter",54.28,"<p>The TapeTech 90T Filler Adapter attaches to the TapeTech 72TT or 76TT EasyClean™ Pumps to fill Corner Applicators, Nail Spotters and EasyClean™, EasyClean™ High Capacity or Power Assist™ Finishing boxes with joint compound. Use with gasket 700049 (not included).</p>"
