"TapeTech","AB0003","Ames Cobra Banjo Replacement Cutting Blade AB0003",4.37,"<p>Replacement cutting blade for the Ames AB0004 Cobra Drywall Tape Banjo.</p>"
"TapeTech","BAN001TT","TapeTech Mud Dog Banjo",57.25,"<p>The TapeTech Premium Mud Dog Taping Banjo (BAN001 TT) is loaded with features like side straps for left or right handed use, a cutting blade / roller assembly, and a truly ergonomic handle. Perfect for smaller jobs, this banjos functional design beats taping joints by hand. The Mud Dog also holds 33% more compound than traditional banjos, so you get more taping done between fills.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Adjustable Mud Flow</li> <li>Lightweight Polycarbonate / ABS</li> <li>33% More Capacity.</li> <li>Holds Up To 500' Rolls</li> <li>Right Or Left Hand Use</li> <li>Ergonomic Handle</li> <li>Easy Install Cutting Blade</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","BH","TapeTech Brakeless Finishing Box Handle",99.12,"<p>Perfect for both new or experienced ATF tool users. No learning curve, the friction brake design eliminates the need for new users to learn how and when to properly apply the brake found on traditional finishing box handles. Experienced users, these handles give your hands a permanent vacation after years of squeezing traditional brake-style handles.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Easy To Clean</li> <li>Durable Fiberglass</li> <li>Easy Grip Star Knob</li> <li>Optimal Diameter Handle</li> <li>34"" Length</li> <li>Works With All TapeTech And Other Major Brand Flat Boxes</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","BHE","TapeTech Brakeless Extendable Finishing Box Handle",214.0,"<p>Perfect for both new or experienced ATF tool users. No learning curve, the friction brake design eliminates the need for new users to learn how and when to properly apply the brake found on traditional finishing box handles. Experienced users, these handles give your hands a permanent vacation after years of squeezing traditional brake-style handles.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Easy To Clean</li> <li>Durable Fiberglass</li> <li>Easy Grip Star Knob</li> <li>Optimal Diameter Handle</li> <li>Extends From 34"" - 60""</li> <li>Works With All TapeTech And Other Major Brand Flat Boxes</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","BHESW","TapeTech SideWinder Extendable Brakeless Box Handle",238.55,"<p>The SideWinder is a brakeless box handle with rotating head that allows you to comfortably finish high horizontal joints by keeping the box and handle at the optimal angle for performance. The SideWinder has the same features as our other brakeless handles with the added convenience of the rotating head.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>7 Position Rotating Head For Optimal Positioning of the Finishing Box</li> <li>Extends From 34″ to 60″ (86cm to 152cm)</li> <li>Attaches To All TapeTech And Most Other Brand Of Finishing Boxes</li> <li>Oversized Easy to Grip Star Knob</li> <li>Easy to Clean Fiberglass Construction</li> <li>Optimal Diameter For Gripping</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","CA07TT","7 in TapeTech Corner Applicator",206.89,"<p>The TapeTech Corner Applicator supplies joint compound to the Corner Finishers for fast and efficient finishing of internal corners (angles). Corner Applicators are also used with Applicator Heads to quickly and cleanly apply joint compound to internal or external corners for the installation of paper-faced corner bead. TapeTech Corner Applicators feature a stainless steel cone. Use with the FHTT Fiberglass Handle or the XHTT Extension Handle – not included.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Applies joint compound to external corners for paper faced bead application (with 16TT)</li> <li>Applies joint compound to inside corner for tape application (with 16TT90)</li> <li>Finishes internal corners (with corner finishers)</li> <li>Stainless steel cone</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","CA08TT","8"" Corner Applicator",218.63,"<p> The TapeTech Corner Applicator supplies joint compound to the Corner Finishers for fast and efficient finishing of internal corners (angles). Corner Applicators are also used with Mud Heads to quickly and cleanly apply joint compound to internal or external corners for the installation of paper-faced corner bead. TapeTech Corner Applicators feature a stainless steel cone. Use with the FHTT Fiberglass Handle or the XHTT Extension Handle not included. <br></p><ul><li> Applies joint compound to external corners for paper faced bead application (with 16TT)</li><li>Applies joint compound to inside corner for tape application (with 16TT90)</li><li>Finishes internal corners (with corner finishers) <br></li></ul>"
"TapeTech","CAATT","TapeTech Corner Applicator Adapter",29.8,"<p>TapeTech has been the number one selling brand of automatic taping and finishing tools for the drywall industry for over 30 years. TapeTech tools are known for quality design, engineering and performance.</p> <ul> <li>Corner applicator adapter for TapeTech Fiberglass (FHTT) or Extension (XHTT) handles</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","CF25TT","2.5"" Corner Flusher - Semi-Automatic",70.88,"<p>TapeTech Corner Flushers make quick work of wiping or finishing inside corners. Direct flushers are used to apply joint compound to internal corners. Indirect flushers simply smooth compound that has been applied by another tool. TapeTech flushers work as both a direct and indirect flusher. That means you don’t have to decide which model to get, only which sizes fit your needs. The Corner Flushers fit all TapeTech corner tools (Compound Tubes, 88TTF and HF handles, 35TT and 50TT Corner Applicators and 14TT MudRunner®).</p>"
"TapeTech","CF30TT","3"" Corner Flusher - Semi-Automatic",69.08,"<p>TapeTech Corner Flushers make quick work of wiping or finishing inside corners. Direct flushers are used to apply joint compound to internal corners. Indirect flushers simply smooth compound that has been applied by another tool. TapeTech flushers work as both a direct and indirect flusher. That means you don’t have to decide which model to get, only which sizes fit your needs. The Corner Flushers fit all TapeTech corner tools (Compound Tubes, 88TTF and HF handles, 35TT and 50TT Corner Applicators and 14TT MudRunner®).</p>"
"TapeTech","CF35TT","3.5"" Corner Flusher - Semi-Automatic",69.35,"<p>TapeTech Corner Flushers make quick work of wiping or finishing inside corners. Direct flushers are used to apply joint compound to internal corners. Indirect flushers simply smooth compound that has been applied by another tool. TapeTech flushers work as both a direct and indirect flusher. That means you don’t have to decide which model to get, only which sizes fit your needs. The Corner Flushers fit all TapeTech corner tools (Compound Tubes, 88TTF and HF handles, 35TT and 50TT Corner Applicators and 14TT MudRunner®).</p>"
"TapeTech","CF40TT","4"" Corner Flusher - Semi-Automatic",72.86,"<p>TapeTech Corner Flushers make quick work of wiping or finishing inside corners. Direct flushers are used to apply joint compound to internal corners. Indirect flushers simply smooth compound that has been applied by another tool. TapeTech flushers work as both a direct and indirect flusher. That means you don’t have to decide which model to get, only which sizes fit your needs. The Corner Flushers fit all TapeTech corner tools (Compound Tubes, 88TTF and HF handles, 35TT and 50TT Corner Applicators and 14TT MudRunner®).</p>"
"TapeTech","CFATT","TapeTech Corner Finisher Adapter",34.04,"<p>TapeTech has been the number one selling brand of automatic taping and finishing tools for the drywall industry for over 30 years. TapeTech tools are known for quality design, engineering and performance.</p> <ul> <li>Corner finisher adapter for TapeTech Fiberglass (FHTT) or Extension (XHTT) handles</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","CNATT","Cleaning Nozzle Adapter",10.83,"<p>The Adapter securely threads onto the Spray Nozzle and fits over the filler valve of the Automatic Taper to thoroughly clean the valve and the head without soaking the user. It can also be used to quickly clean the filler valve on the MudRunner® or Corner Applicators. Works with most brands of Automatic Tapers.</p>"
"TapeTech","CNTT","Cleaning Nozzle",10.22,"<p>Cleaning Nozzle</p>"
"TapeTech","CT24TT","24"" Compound Tube - Semi-Automatic",129.64,"<p>TapeTech Compound Tubes supply joint compound to Corner Flushers for finishing inside corners. Also attaches to TapeTech Applicator Heads for applying corner bead to internal and external corners. Available in three sizes, the Compound Tubes disassemble for easy cleaning.</p>"
"TapeTech","CT36TT","36"" Compound Tube - Semi-Automatic",137.96,"<p>TapeTech Compound Tubes supply joint compound to Corner Flushers for finishing inside corners. Also attaches to TapeTech Applicator Heads for applying corner bead to internal and external corners. Available in three sizes, the Compound Tubes disassemble for easy cleaning.</p>"
"TapeTech","CT42TT","42"" Compound Tube - Semi-Automatic",147.76,"<p>TapeTech Compound Tubes supply joint compound to Corner Flushers for finishing inside corners. Also attaches to TapeTech Applicator Heads for applying corner bead to internal and external corners. Available in three sizes, the Compound Tubes disassemble for easy cleaning.</p>"
"TapeTech","CTA01TT","Compound Tube Filler Adapter",12.57,"<p>The TapeTech Compound Tube Filler Adapter, together with any size compound tube, is an alternative to filling finishing boxes with the loading pump. It quickly attaches to compound tubes by removing the outlet assembly, inserting the Filler Adapter and securing it with the quick-release latches. Joint compound is drawn from the bucket making it easier to use when working on scaffolding.&nbsp;</p>"
"TapeTech","EABS127TTSM","TapeTech Premium ABS Float – Smooth",7.68,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-3ye23oez resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>The TapeTech EABS127-TTSM Premium ABS Float is the preferred design for EIFS. The 5″ x 11″ float is constructed of unbreakable ABS plastic and has rounded corners to prevent digging or gouging. This float is “ready to go” right off the shelf. The base is textured to gently roll the corn to achieve the perfect finish every time. The handle design is preferred by professionals and the light weight makes this float comfortable for all day use.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""vc_column_container col-md-12""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner"">&nbsp;</div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","EABS127TTTX","TapeTech Premium ABS Float – Textured",7.68,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-y8qymjat resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>The TapeTech EABS127-TTTX Premium ABS Float is the preferred design for EIFS. The 5″ x 11″ float is constructed of unbreakable ABS plastic and has rounded corners to prevent digging or gouging. This float is “ready to go” right off the shelf. The base of EABS127-TTTX features slightly more texture than our popular EABS127-TTSM Float to produce a more pronounced texture. The handle design is preferred by professionals and the light weight makes this float comfortable for all day use.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","EALFED48","TapeTech 4′ Aluminum Featheredge",20.95,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-8exk7eu2 resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>TapeTech featheredges are perfect for squaring up inside corners and smoothing stucco, EIFS or plaster. Made from aluminum, the 2 mm extrusion is thicker than competitive featheredges, resulting in a more ridgid plane and straighter, flatter surfaces. Comfortable H-Shape allows you to easily adjust the angle of the featheredge using just your thumb and palm. Extremely long-lasting, TapeTech featheredges include a 10mm hole to hang the tool. Available in 4′, 5′ or 6′ lengths.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","EALFED60","TapeTech 5′ Aluminum Featheredge",25.12,"<p>TapeTech featheredges are perfect for squaring up inside corners and smoothing stucco, EIFS or plaster. Made from aluminum, the 2 mm extrusion is thicker than competitive featheredges, resulting in a more ridgid plane and straighter, flatter surfaces. Comfortable H-Shape allows you to easily adjust the angle of the featheredge using just your thumb and palm. Extremely long-lasting, TapeTech featheredges include a 10mm hole to hang the tool. Available in 4′, 5′ or 6′ lengths.</p>"
"TapeTech","EALFED72","TapeTech 6′ Aluminum Featheredge",31.41,"<p>TapeTech featheredges are perfect for squaring up inside corners and smoothing stucco, EIFS or plaster. Made from aluminum, the 2 mm extrusion is thicker than competitive featheredges, resulting in a more ridgid plane and straighter, flatter surfaces. Comfortable H-Shape allows you to easily adjust the angle of the featheredge using just your thumb and palm. Extremely long-lasting, TapeTech featheredges include a 10mm hole to hang the tool. Available in 4′, 5′ or 6′ lengths.</p>"
"TapeTech","EEX15090","TapeTech 1.5″ Stiff Outside Corner Edger for 90°",6.17,"<p>TapeTech Outside Corner Edgers for 90° Corners are designed to produce smooth, uniform and square 90° outside corners for EIFS, Stucco, Plaster, Concrete and other materials. Handcrafted from 0.65mm stainless steel, TapeTech corner edgers are robust enough to efficiently create perfect results in thick materials. Custom wood handles are ergonomic for all-day use and the unique TapeTech black and gold design helps distinguish your tools from others on the jobsite.</p>"
"TapeTech","EEXSET3135","TapeTech 3 Piece 135° Outside Corner Edgers Set",16.97,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-rmqox83l resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>Contains on each of the outside corner trowel sizes – 1.25″, 2″, and 2.75″. TapeTech Outside Corner Edgers for 135o Corners are designed to produce smooth, uniform outside corners at 45o wall junctures for EIFS, Stucco, Plaster, Concrete and other materials. Handcrafted from 0.65mm stainless steel, TapeTech corner edgers are robust enough to efficiently create perfect results in thick materials. Custom wood handles are ergonomic for all-day use and the unique TapeTech black and gold design helps distinguish your tools from others on the jobsite. Available in three sizes for ultimate versatility in nearly every situation.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","EEXSET590","TapeTech 5 Piece 90° Outside Corner Edger Set",25.65,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-eolocm5f resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>Contains one each of the outside corner trowel sizes – 0.5″, 0.75″, 1″, 1.5″, and 2″. TapeTech Outside Corner Edgers for 90° Corners are designed to produce smooth, uniform and square 90° inside corners for EIFS, Stucco, Plaster, Concrete and other materials. Handcrafted from 0.65mm stainless steel, TapeTech corner edgers are robust enough to efficiently create perfect results in thick materials. Custom wood handles are ergonomic for all-day use and the unique TapeTech black and gold design helps distinguish your tools from others on the jobsite. Available in five sizes for ultimate versatility in nearly every situation.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","EFLOAT0512G","TapeTech 12″ x 5″ x 3/4″ Green Foam Float",2.51,"<p>TapeTech Green Foam Floats are the industry standard for stucco and other materials. They have an open cell design that pulls sand and aggregates to the surface, bringing out the texture of the material.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Pulls sand and aggregates to the surface, creating the desired texture in the material.</li> <li>Heavy Duty aluminum plate is bonded to the float using pro grade adhesives.</li> <li>The lightweight foam reduces worker fatigue.</li> <li>The natural wood handle is ideal for all day use.</li> <li>The 12” x 5” float is the industry standard for stucco, plaster, concrete and other materials.</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EFLOAT0512N","TapeTech 12″ x 5″ x 1/4″ EVA Neo Float",4.6,"<p>EVA Floats are ideal when working the brown coat application of stucco and plaster. The EVA pad is non-porous and is very effective at compressing the material. The rigidity of the pad allows you to shape inside corners and crisp lines in the stucco or other material.</p> <h4>Features:</h4> <ul> <li>The hard rubber pad is ideal for working the brown coat in stucco and plaster.</li> <li>Heavy Duty aluminum plate is bonded to the float using pro grade adhesives.</li> <li>The ¼” thick pad reduces worker fatigue.</li> <li>The natural wood handle is ideal for all day use.</li> <li>The 12” x 5” float is the industry standard for stucco, plaster, and other materials.</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EFLOAT0512W","TapeTech 12″ x 5″ x 3/4″ White Foam Float",2.51,"<p>TapeTech White Foam Floats have a closed cell structure and produce a finer, smoother finish when working with stucco, plaster, concrete, and other trades.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>White foam holds more water and results in a smoother finish in all materials.</li> <li>Heavy Duty aluminum plate is bonded to the float using pro grade adhesives.</li> <li>The lightweight foam reduces worker fatigue</li> <li>The natural wood handle is ideal for all day use.</li> <li>The 12” x 5” float is the industry standard for stucco, plaster, concrete and other materials.</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EHC07W","7"" MAXXBOX Extra High Capacity Finishing Box w/ EasyRoll Wheels",284.0,"<p>Introducing the first high capacity finishing boxes designed to hold the right amount of joint compound when you really need it on the first or second coat when you re filling the joint without the unnecessary weight when you don t need it on the finish coat. The NEW TapeTech MAXXBOX Finishing Boxes are designed with the optimum capacity to weight ratio. This means that you get more usable joint compound the amount that you can actually get out of the finishing box and onto the wall when you actually need it, like on the first coat. The TapeTech 7 MAXXBOX finishing box delivers 94% more usable joint compound than the standard EasyClean finishing box (model 20TTX) and up to 68% more usable capacity than competitive high capacity finishing boxes. Step up to the boxes designed to hold and deliver the right amount. Every time. Every box. MAXXBOX .</p><p><br></p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joint</li><li>NOW with EasyRoll Wheels</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EHC10W","10"" MAXXBOX Extra High Capacity Finishing Box w/ EasyRoll Wheels",291.11,"<p>Introducing the first high capacity finishing boxes designed to hold the right amount of joint compound when you really need it on the first or second coat when you re filling the joint without the unnecessary weight when you don t need it on the finish coat. The NEW TapeTech MAXXBOX Finishing Boxes are designed with the optimum capacity to weight ratio. This means that you get more usable joint compound the amount that you can actually get out of the finishing box and onto the wall when you actually need it, like on the first coat. The TapeTech 7 MAXXBOX finishing box delivers 94% more usable joint compound than the standard EasyClean finishing box (model 20TTX) and up to 68% more usable capacity than competitive high capacity finishing boxes. Step up to the boxes designed to hold and deliver the right amount. Every time. Every box. MAXXBOX .</p> <p><br></p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joint</li> <li>NOW with EasyRoll Wheels</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EHC12W","12"" MAXXBOX Extra High Capacity Finishing Box w/ EasyRoll Wheels",319.24,"<p>Introducing the first high capacity finishing boxes designed to hold the right amount of joint compound when you really need it on the first or second coat when you re filling the joint without the unnecessary weight when you don t need it on the finish coat. The NEW TapeTech MAXXBOX Finishing Boxes are designed with the optimum capacity to weight ratio. This means that you get more usable joint compound the amount that you can actually get out of the finishing box and onto the wall when you actually need it, like on the first coat. The TapeTech 7 MAXXBOX finishing box delivers 94% more usable joint compound than the standard EasyClean finishing box (model 20TTX) and up to 68% more usable capacity than competitive high capacity finishing boxes. Step up to the boxes designed to hold and deliver the right amount. Every time. Every box. MAXXBOX .</p> <p><br></p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joint</li> <li>NOW with EasyRoll Wheels</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EHWJS100","TapeTech Portable Hot Wire Foam Cutter",471.6,"<p>The TapeTech EHWJS100 Portable Jobsite Hot Wire is the industry’s most portable and versatile hot wire machine. Ideally suited for EIFS and other foam-cutting professional, the EHWJS100 quickly cuts and notches EPS and XPS foam with unmatched precision. The EHWJS100 weighs just 30 pounds and sets up in under 2 minutes. It can make straight through cuts, including ripping thicker panels to thinner dimensions, miter cuts, bevel cuts, compound miters and notches in the face or end of foam panels. EHWJS100 includes a scaffolding strap to securely strap the unit to the railing of scaffolding and staging to prevent accidental equipment falls. The superalloy NiChrome hot wire heats to 932°F (500°C) in seconds to make any jobsite a highly productive foam-cutting environment. Features a spring-loaded safety switch. The hot wire element (EHW100) is easy to replace and requires no tools. Hot wire lasts approximately 70 hours of cutting time. Max. Cutting Height 50.8″ (1290 mm)<br>Max. Cutting Thickness 13″ (330 mm)<br>Rulers Left: 39″ (1000 mm); 0-60″ / Right: 15″ (400 mm)<br>Net Weight 30 pounds (13.5 kg)<br>Assembled Size 63″ x 17″ x 8″ (1610 X 440 X 200 mm)<br>Power Supply 110V<br>Replacement Hot Wire EHW100</p>"
"TapeTech","EIFSAND0614","TapeTech 6″ x 14″ EIFS Vacuum Hand Rasp",171.24,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-8ukbvj1m resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>The TapeTech EIFSand™ Vacuum Hand Rasp is constructed from durable aircraft grade aluminum and weighs just 3.5 pounds. The 6″ x 14″ tool quickly attaches to the TapeTech EIFSand™ EIFSAND120/EIFSAND18V, or any standard commercial vacuum, to remove waste as you sand EPS/XPS foam panels. It features a replaceable Tungsten Carbide pad that produces fast material removal and lasts more than 100 times longer than traditional paper abrasives. The wide handle allows the worker to use two hands, reducing fatigue.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","EIN15090","TapeTech 1.5″ Stiff Inside Corner Edger for 90°",6.17,"<p>TapeTech Inside Corner Edgers for 90° Corners are designed to produce smooth, uniform and square 90° inside corners for EIFS, Stucco, Plaster, Concrete and other materials. Handcrafted from 0.65mm stainless steel, TapeTech corner edgers are robust enough to efficiently create perfect results in thick materials. Custom wood handles are ergonomic for all-day use and the unique TapeTech black and gold design helps distinguish your tools from others on the jobsite.</p>"
"TapeTech","EINSET590","TapeTech 5 Piece 90° Inside Corner Edger Set",25.65,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-k1olqlp0 resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>Contains one each of the inside corner trowel sizes &nbsp;– 0.5″, 0.75″, 1″, 1.5″, and 2″. TapeTech Inside Corner Edgers for 90° Corners are designed to produce smooth, uniform and square 90° inside corners for EIFS, Stucco, Plaster, Concrete and other materials. Handcrafted from 0.65mm stainless steel, TapeTech corner edgers are robust enough to efficiently create perfect results in thick materials. Custom wood handles are ergonomic for all-day use and the unique TapeTech black and gold design helps distinguish your tools from others on the jobsite. Available in five sizes for ultimate versatility in nearly every situation.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","ERASP0214","TapeTech 2″ x 14″ Tungsten Carbide Rasp",45.12,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-2hy7ifi4 resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>TapeTech EIFSand™ Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasps provide a high removal rate and long life; more than 100 times longer than standard abrasive rasp paper! Their hard and durable tungsten carbide composition removes EPS/XPS Foam quickly and easily. The rounded corner design prevents gouging and the ergonomic handle design allows the worker to use two hands, reducing hand fatigue.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","ERASP0414","TapeTech 4″ x 14″ Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasp",57.85,"<p>TapeTech Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasps provide a high removal rate and long life; more than 100 times longer than standard abrasive rasp paper! Their hard and durable tungsten carbide composition removes EPS/XPS Foam quickly and easily. The rounded corner design prevents gouging and the ergonomic handle design allows the worker to use two hands, reducing hand fatigue.</p>"
"TapeTech","ERASP0614","TapeTech 6″ x 14″ Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasp",70.58,"<p>TapeTech EIFSand? Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasps provide a high removal rate and long life; more than 100 times longer than standard abrasive rasp paper! Their hard and durable tungsten carbide composition removes EPS/XPS Foam quickly and easily. The rounded corner design prevents gouging and the ergonomic handle design allows the worker to use two hands, reducing hand fatigue.</p>"
"TapeTech","ERASP0814","TapeTech 8″ x 14″ Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasp",90.94,"TAPETECH 8""X14"" TUNGSTEN CARBIDE EIFS RASP"
"TapeTech","ERASPSERRATED0414","TapeTech 4″ x 14″ Tungsten Carbide EIFS Claw Rasp",64.79,"<div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>TapeTech Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasps provide a high removal rate and long life; more than 100 times longer than standard abrasive rasp paper! Their hard and durable tungsten carbide composition removes EPS/XPS Foam quickly and easily. The unique claw design on one side allows the worker to cut foam panels that overhang corners and edges. The rounded corner design prevents gouging and the ergonomic handle design allows the worker to use two hands, reducing hand fatigue.</p> </div>"
"TapeTech","ERASPSERRATED0614","TapeTech 6"" x 14"" Tungsten Carbide Claw Rasp",77.52,"<div id=""product-details-information-tab-content-container-0"" class=""product-details-information-tab-content-container"" data-type=""information-content-text"">TapeTech EIFSand™ Tungsten Carbide EIFS Rasps provide a high removal rate and long life; more than 100 times longer than standard abrasive rasp paper! Their hard and durable tungsten carbide composition removes EPS/XPS Foam quickly and easily. The unique claw design on one side allows the worker to cut foam panels that overhang corners and edges. The rounded corner design prevents gouging and the ergonomic handle design allows the worker to use two hands, reducing hand fatigue.</div> <div class=""product-warning"">&nbsp;</div>"
"TapeTech","EZ07TT","7"" EasyClean Finishing Box",264.31,"<p> The TapeTech EasyClean Finishing Box automatically dispenses the proper amount of joint compound and feathers the edges of butt joints and flat joints in one pass. The EasyClean Finishing Box helps produce professional results every time. The adjustable crown setting dial allows the user to easily adjust the amount of joint compound applied over the tape on the drywall joint. This is very helpful when progressing from the first finishing application to the second or third application. The pivoting axle helps to compensate when the drywall or sheetrock on one side of the joint is higher than the other side of the joint. The new EasyRoll wheel system allows you to expertly finish all types of outside corner bead up to two times faster than finishing by hand. EasyRoll wheels work with all types of outside corner bead including metal, paper-faced, vinyl and bullnose. EasyRoll wheels provide a shoulder to guide the finishing box along the corner bead without after-market attachments or damage to the axle. The shoulder of the EasyRoll wheels is more than three times wider than after-market products, making it easier to place, and keep, the finishing box on the corner bead. And EasyRoll wheels are engineered and designed to be perfectly aligned with the finishing blade, eliminating the need to tilt the finishing box like you must with common after-market wheel systems. EasyRoll wheels do not affect how the finishing box runs on standard flat joints. All TapeTech finishing boxes now feature EasyRoll wheels for finishing outside corner bead. </p><ul><li> Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joints<br></li></ul>"
"TapeTech","EZ10TT","10"" EasyClean Finishing Box",274.18,"<p> The TapeTech EasyClean Finishing Box automatically dispenses the proper amount of joint compound and feathers the edges of butt joints and flat joints in one pass. The EasyClean Finishing Box helps produce professional results every time. The adjustable crown setting dial allows the user to easily adjust the amount of joint compound applied over the tape on the drywall joint. This is very helpful when progressing from the first finishing application to the second or third application. The pivoting axle helps to compensate when the drywall or sheetrock on one side of the joint is higher than the other side of the joint. The new EasyRoll wheel system allows you to expertly finish all types of outside corner bead up to two times faster than finishing by hand. EasyRoll wheels work with all types of outside corner bead including metal, paper-faced, vinyl and bullnose. EasyRoll wheels provide a shoulder to guide the finishing box along the corner bead without after-market attachments or damage to the axle. The shoulder of the EasyRoll wheels is more than three times wider than after-market products, making it easier to place, and keep, the finishing box on the corner bead. And EasyRoll wheels are engineered and designed to be perfectly aligned with the finishing blade, eliminating the need to tilt the finishing box like you must with common after-market wheel systems. EasyRoll wheels do not affect how the finishing box runs on standard flat joints. All TapeTech finishing boxes now feature EasyRoll wheels for finishing outside corner bead. </p> <ul> <li> Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joints<br></li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","EZ12TT","12 in TapeTech EasyClean Finishing Box",284.0,"<p>The TapeTech EasyClean® Finishing Box automatically dispenses the proper amount of joint compound and feathers the edges of butt joints and flat joints in one pass. The EasyClean Finishing Box helps produce professional results every time. The adjustable crown setting dial allows the user to easily adjust the amount of joint compound applied over the tape on the drywall joint. This is very helpful when progressing from the first finishing application to the second or third application. The pivoting axle helps to compensate when the drywall or sheetrock on one side of the joint is higher than the other side of the joint. The new EasyRoll™ wheel system allows you to expertly finish all types of outside corner bead up to two times faster than finishing by hand. EasyRoll™ wheels work with all types of outside corner bead including metal, paper-faced, vinyl and bullnose. EasyRoll™ wheels provide a shoulder to guide the finishing box along the corner bead without after-market attachments or damage to the axle. The shoulder of the EasyRoll wheels is more than three times wider than after-market products, making it easier to place, and keep, the finishing box on the corner bead. And EasyRoll™ wheels are engineered and designed to be perfectly aligned with the finishing blade, eliminating the need to tilt the finishing box like you must with common after-market wheel systems. EasyRoll™ wheels do not affect how the finishing box runs on standard flat joints. All TapeTech finishing boxes now feature EasyRoll™ wheels for finishing outside corner bead.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li> <li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joints</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","FHTT","TapeTech Fiberglass Handle",39.19,"<p>TapeTech is the first company to introduce an interchangeable handle system that allows one support handle to be used with every tool. Whether you use standard, fixed length fiberglass handles or aluminum extension support handles, you’ll need just one base handle.</p> <p>The base handle for the fiberglass system is model FHTT. The base handle for the extension handle system is model XHTT. The base handle fits the corner roller, corner applicator and nail spotter without any adapters. The heavy duty, easy-to-change adapters (CFA-TT) connect the new handles to the corner finishers. And the new, optimal diameter makes TapeTech handles the most ergonomic in the industry.</p> <p>Both base handles feature a D-shaped fitting that securely positions the handle in the Corner Applicator and positively prevents the tool from rotating during use.</p> <p>Note: If you use your current Nail Spotters with the new handle system you will need to mount the handle in the back holes of the tabs on the Nail Spotter.</p>"
"TapeTech","FHTTCC","TapeTech Closet Crusher 18"" Support Handle",34.64,"<p>TapeTech Closet Crusher 18"" Support Handle</p>"
"TapeTech","GSRTT","TapeTech Gooseneck Riser",6.56,"<p>TapeTech Gooseneck Riser</p>"
"TapeTech","HWK001PS","TapeTech 13″ x 13″ Aluminum Hawk",21.98,"<p>Professional Grade ultra-light aluminum Hawk with 1.75mm tray features milled grooves to prevent slippage of compound, plaster, EIFS material or stucco. Rubber cushion under tray provides comfort and prevents abrasions. Features the ergonomic TapeTech ProSoft grip for all-day comfort and reduced fatigue.</p>"
"TapeTech","JCT01TT","TapeTech Jam Clearing Tool",3.52,"<p><span data-teams=""true"">TapeTech created this tape and mud jam clearing tool to swiftly unclog automatic taper jams, avoiding slowdowns on the jobsite. Regular use helps prolong the life of your taping tools and guarantees smooth, efficient drywall finishing job after job</span></p> <p><strong>Features:</strong></p> <ul> <li><span data-teams=""true"">Rapidly clears natural tape and mud blockages in drywall taping tools to keep tape flowing smoothly and extending the longevity of the tools&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-teams=""true"">Excellent for clearing automatic taper jams as well as mud buildup in mud pumps and finishing boxes</span></li> <li><span data-teams=""true"">Lightweight and easy to carry for quick access on job sites</span></li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","JS01","TapeTech 6.5″ Carbon Steel Jab Saw",5.7,"<p>The TapeTech 6.5″ Carbon Steel Jab Saw is a heavy-duty cutting tool built for precision and durability. Featuring an extra-thick high carbon steel blade, this saw is designed to handle the toughest materials, including drywall, PVC, and cement board, with ease. The sharpened point allows for easy puncturing, making plunge cuts a breeze, while the triple ground hardened teeth ensure fast cutting and long-lasting performance. The saw’s ergonomic handle provides a comfortable, secure grip, reducing fatigue during extended use. Ideal for professional contractors, the TapeTech jab saw is built for efficiency and reliability, delivering unmatched results in every cut.</p> <p><strong>Features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Sharpened Point</li> <li>Extra-Thick High Carbon Steel</li> <li>Thick Ground Hardened Teeth</li> <li>Ergonomic Handle</li> <li>Perfect For Drywall, PVC, and Cement Board</li> <li>8 TPI</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","MP0012","12 in AMES Feather-Lite Stainless Steel Pan",13.39,"<p>AMES offers a variety of drywall tools for all your drywall and plastering needs.</p>"
"TapeTech","MP12TT","TapeTech 12"" Premium Mud Pan",9.44,"<p>TapeTech 12"" Premium Mud Pan</p>"
"TapeTech","MP14TT","TapeTech 14"" Premium Mud Pan",10.34,"<p>TapeTech 14"" Premium Mud Pan</p>"
"TapeTech","MR01TT","TapeTech MudRunner Pro",762.08,"<p>TapeTech MudRunner® Pro MR01TT</p> <p>The new second generation MudRunner® Pro tool applies joint compound to inside and outside corners faster and with precision control and minimal effort. The new MudRunner® Pro offers a tremendous update in the efficiency of finishing corners in drywall. The tool offers more versatility when needed in adjustment to length, both integrated and with the MRX01TT extension (sold separately). The new MudRunner® Pro also offers a 20% increase in piston strength for greater compound application.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Adjustable Length: 52.5″ – 60.5″</li> <li>Use With Any Inside Or Outside Corner Finisher</li> <li>Thicker Mud Applies Effortlessly</li> <li>Clear Tube For Visible Mud Level</li> <li>Reduces Wear-and-Tear On Your Shoulders</li> <li>Requires A Pump/Filler To Fill</li> <li>Requires An Applicator Head To Apply/Finish</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","MT01","TapeTech 9-1 Stainless Steel Multi-Tool",5.23,"<p>The TapeTech 9-1 Stainless Steel Multi-Tool is the ultimate all-in-one tool for professionals. Made from high-quality stainless steel, it is rust-resistant, ensuring durability even in tough job site conditions. Compact yet powerful, the TapeTech 9-1 Multi-Tool is built for efficiency and reliability, making it an essential addition to every professional’s toolkit.</p> <p><strong>Features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Spreader for smooth application of compounds</li> <li>Chisel scraper and gouger for precision work</li> <li>Nail puller to remove fasteners effortlessly</li> <li>Convex scraper for curved surfaces</li> <li>Standard roller cleaner and small roller cleaner for keeping your tools clean</li> <li>Bottle opener for convenient breaks</li> <li>Hammer end for quick, light-duty hammering</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","MWS01TT","TapeTech Mobile Wash Station",473.42,"<p>The&nbsp;TapeTech MWS01-TT Mobile Wash Station&nbsp;is the lightest and most portable wash station available. Weighing just 34 pounds, it is the perfect solution for cleaning tools and equipment on the job site, especially when water supplies are limited. Working from just a 5-gallon bucket of water, the MWS01-TT generates the ideal water pressure to effectively clean drywall finishing tools, paint brushes, rollers, pans, and more! And the MWS01-TT helps finishers and painters comply with environmental laws by providing a convenient, professional wash station that does not wash the joint compound or paint into the soil. The legs of the MWS01-TT open and close effortlessly for quick set up, break down, and transport.</p>"
"TapeTech","NS02TT","2 in TapeTech EasyClean Nail Spotter",212.56,"<p>The TapeTech EasyClean® Nail Spotter is used to fill the depressions left from the nails or screw heads during installation of the drywall. The Nail Spotter features an easy clean box design that removes excess compound at the same time as filling the depressions. The hardened steel skid plate allows the Nail Spotter to move along the wall smoothly while protecting the stainless steel blade from nail or screw heads that were not fully set below the surface of the drywall. The XHTT extension handle and FHTT fiberglass handle are available separately.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Fills depressions caused by nail or screw heads in drywall</li> <li>Removes excess joint compound after filling dimples</li> <li>EasyClean® design</li> <li>Stainless steel construction</li> <li>Skid design extends blade life over wheel designs</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","NS03TT","3 in TapeTech EasyClean Nail Spotter",219.17,"<p>The TapeTech EasyClean® Nail Spotter is used to fill the depressions left from the nails or screw heads during installation of the drywall. The Nail Spotter features an easy clean box design that removes excess compound at the same time as filling the depressions. The hardened steel skid plate allows the Nail Spotter to move along the wall smoothly while protecting the stainless steel blade from nail or screw heads that were not fully set below the surface of the drywall.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Fills depressions caused by nail or screw heads in drywall</li> <li>Removes excess joint compound after filling dimples</li> <li>EasyClean® design</li> <li>Stainless steel construction</li> <li>Skid design extends blade life over wheel designs</li> <li>Weight: 1.50 lbs</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","NSATT","TapeTech Nail Spotter Adapter",29.9,"<p>Nail spotter adapter for TapeTech Fiberglass (FHTT) or Extension (XHTT) handles.</p>"
"TapeTech","PAHC07","7"" Power Assist MAXXBOX Finishing Box",343.88,"<p>Introducing the new Power Assist MAXXBOX finishing boxes from TapeTech . Now you can have the extra capacity you want with half the effort required from other high capacity finishing boxes. Featuring the same smart design that matches the usable capacity to the application, the Power Assist MAXXBOX is sure to become the industry standard for finishing! These boxes work with all TapeTech finishing handles, including the 8000TT-PA Wizard handle for Power Assist boxes. With a usable joint compound capacity that varies by less than 10% across the range, the TapeTech Power Assist finishing boxes hold the right amount of joint compound to keep you on the wall longer without wearing you out. The Power Assist series features TapeTech s famous EasyClean design. The adjustable crown setting dial allows the user to easily adjust the amount of joint compound applied over the tape on the drywall joint. This is very helpful when progressing from the first embedding application to the second or third finishing coat. The pivoting axle helps to compensate when the drywall or sheetrock on one side of the joint is higher than the other side of the joint. The new EasyRoll wheel system allows you to expertly finish all types of outside corner bead up to two times faster than finishing by hand. EasyRoll wheels work with all types of outside corner bead including metal, paper-faced, vinyl and bullnose. EasyRoll wheels provide a shoulder to guide the finishing box along the corner bead without after-market attachments or damage to the axle. The shoulder of the EasyRoll wheels is more than three times wider than after-market products, making it easier to place, and keep, the finishing box on the corner bead. And EasyRoll wheels are engineered and designed to be perfectly aligned with the finishing blade, eliminating the need to tilt the finishing box like you must with common after-market wheel systems. EasyRoll wheels do not affect how the finishing box runs on standard flat joints. All TapeTech finishing boxes now feature EasyRoll wheels for finishing outside corner bead.</p><ul><li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joints</li><li>EasyFinish bent handles help to activate the Power Assist mechanism<br></li></ul>"
"TapeTech","PAHC10","10"" Power Assist MAXXBOX Finishing Box",346.45,"<p>Introducing the new Power Assist MAXXBOX finishing boxes from TapeTech . Now you can have the extra capacity you want with half the effort required from other high capacity finishing boxes. Featuring the same smart design that matches the usable capacity to the application, the Power Assist MAXXBOX is sure to become the industry standard for finishing! These boxes work with all TapeTech finishing handles, including the 8000TT-PA Wizard handle for Power Assist boxes. With a usable joint compound capacity that varies by less than 10% across the range, the TapeTech Power Assist finishing boxes hold the right amount of joint compound to keep you on the wall longer without wearing you out. The Power Assist series features TapeTechs famous EasyClean design. The adjustable crown setting dial allows the user to easily adjust the amount of joint compound applied over the tape on the drywall joint. This is very helpful when progressing from the first embedding application to the second or third finishing coat. The pivoting axle helps to compensate when the drywall or sheetrock on one side of the joint is higher than the other side of the joint. The new EasyRoll wheel system allows you to expertly finish all types of outside corner bead up to two times faster than finishing by hand. EasyRoll wheels work with all types of outside corner bead including metal, paper-faced, vinyl and bullnose. EasyRoll wheels provide a shoulder to guide the finishing box along the corner bead without after-market attachments or damage to the axle. The shoulder of the EasyRoll wheels is more than three times wider than after-market products, making it easier to place, and keep, the finishing box on the corner bead. And EasyRoll wheels are engineered and designed to be perfectly aligned with the finishing blade, eliminating the need to tilt the finishing box like you must with common after-market wheel systems. EasyRoll wheels do not affect how the finishing box runs on standard flat joints. All TapeTech finishing boxes now feature EasyRoll wheels for finishing outside corner bead.</p><ul><li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joints</li><li>EasyFinish bent handles help to activate the Power Assist mechanism<br></li></ul>"
"TapeTech","PAHC12","12"" Power Assist MAXXBOX Finishing Box",364.11,"<p>Introducing the new Power Assist MAXXBOX finishing boxes from TapeTech . Now you can have the extra capacity you want with half the effort required from other high capacity finishing boxes. Featuring the same smart design that matches the usable capacity to the application, the Power Assist MAXXBOX is sure to become the industry standard for finishing! These boxes work with all TapeTech finishing handles, including the 8000TT-PA Wizard handle for Power Assist boxes. With a usable joint compound capacity that varies by less than 10% across the range, the TapeTech Power Assist finishing boxes hold the right amount of joint compound to keep you on the wall longer without wearing you out. The Power Assist series features TapeTech s famous EasyClean design. The adjustable crown setting dial allows the user to easily adjust the amount of joint compound applied over the tape on the drywall joint. This is very helpful when progressing from the first embedding application to the second or third finishing coat. The pivoting axle helps to compensate when the drywall or sheetrock on one side of the joint is higher than the other side of the joint. The new EasyRoll wheel system allows you to expertly finish all types of outside corner bead up to two times faster than finishing by hand. EasyRoll wheels work with all types of outside corner bead including metal, paper-faced, vinyl and bullnose. EasyRoll wheels provide a shoulder to guide the finishing box along the corner bead without after-market attachments or damage to the axle. The shoulder of the EasyRoll wheels is more than three times wider than after-market products, making it easier to place, and keep, the finishing box on the corner bead. And EasyRoll wheels are engineered and designed to be perfectly aligned with the finishing blade, eliminating the need to tilt the finishing box like you must with common after-market wheel systems. EasyRoll wheels do not affect how the finishing box runs on standard flat joints. All TapeTech finishing boxes now feature EasyRoll wheels for finishing outside corner bead.</p><ul><li>Applies first coat of joint compound to embed tape at butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Finishes butt joints and flat joints on walls and ceilings</li><li>Feathers edges of butt joints and flat joints</li><li>EasyFinish bent handles help to activate the Power Assist mechanism<br></li></ul>"
"TapeTech","PFKHATT","Tapetech Premium Finishing Handle Adapter",9.74,"<p>The New Premium Finishing Knife Handle adapter is more robust, provides quick angle adjustment and improved durability. The Handle Adapter quickly and securely attaches to the TapeTech FHTT or XHTT Support handles. No need to buy another handle for your smoothing knives. The D-Shape fitting prevents twisting. This handle adapter also features a robust wing nut and quick-release cam locks, for easy removal.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Specially Designed For Use With TapeTech Smoothing Blades</li> <li>D-Shape Prevents Twisting</li> <li>Quick-Release Cam Locks</li> <li>Attaches To FHTT Or XHTT Handles</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","PWG18L","TapeTech 18 Gauge Large Work Gloves-10 per pack",3.28,"<p>TapeTech 18 Gauge Work Gloves are designed to deliver exceptional performance and durability for demanding tasks. These gloves feature a nitrile-coated palm and fingers, providing superior abrasion and cut resistance while ensuring a secure, non-slip grip even in wet or oily conditions. The lightweight 18-gauge construction offers flexibility and comfort, allowing for precision and dexterity during extended use. Ideal for professionals working in drywall, EIFS, and decorative finishing, these work gloves combine protection and functionality to enhance safety and efficiency on the job.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Nitrile Coated</li> <li>Abrasion and Cut Resistant</li> <li>Non-Slip Grip</li> <li>18 Gauge Work Gloves</li> <li>Size: Large (10)</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","PWG18M","TapeTech 18 Gauge Medium Work Gloves-11 per pack",3.28,"<p>TapeTech 18 Gauge Work Gloves are designed to deliver exceptional performance and durability for demanding tasks. These gloves feature a nitrile-coated palm and fingers, providing superior abrasion and cut resistance while ensuring a secure, non-slip grip even in wet or oily conditions. The lightweight 18-gauge construction offers flexibility and comfort, allowing for precision and dexterity during extended use. Ideal for professionals working in drywall, EIFS, and decorative finishing, these work gloves combine protection and functionality to enhance safety and efficiency on the job.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Nitrile Coated</li> <li>Abrasion and Cut Resistant</li> <li>Non-Slip Grip</li> <li>18 Gauge Work Gloves</li> <li>Size: Medium (11)</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","PWG21L","TapeTech 21 Gauge Large Work Gloves-10 per pack",3.49,"<p>TapeTech 21 Gauge Work Gloves offer a perfect blend of durability and comfort for precise tasks. Featuring a nitrile-coated design, these gloves provide excellent abrasion and cut resistance while delivering a reliable, non-slip grip for secure handling in any condition. The lightweight 21-gauge construction enhances flexibility and tactile sensitivity, making them ideal for professionals in drywall, EIFS, and decorative finishing. Designed to maximize safety and efficiency, TapeTech 21 Gauge Work Gloves are a must-have for tackling intricate or demanding projects with confidence.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Nitrile Coated</li> <li>Abrasion and Cut Resistant</li> <li>Non-Slip Grip</li> <li>21 Gauge Work Gloves</li> <li>Size: Large (10)</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","PWG21M","TapeTech 21 Gauge Medium Work Gloves-9 per pack",3.49,"<p>TapeTech 21 Gauge Work Gloves offer a perfect blend of durability and comfort for precise tasks. Featuring a nitrile-coated design, these gloves provide excellent abrasion and cut resistance while delivering a reliable, non-slip grip for secure handling in any condition. The lightweight 21-gauge construction enhances flexibility and tactile sensitivity, making them ideal for professionals in drywall, EIFS, and decorative finishing. Designed to maximize safety and efficiency, TapeTech 21 Gauge Work Gloves are a must-have for tackling intricate or demanding projects with confidence.</p> <h2>Features:</h2> <ul> <li>Nitrile Coated</li> <li>Abrasion and Cut Resistant</li> <li>Non-Slip Grip</li> <li>21 Gauge Work Gloves</li> <li>Size: Medium (9)</li> </ul>"
"TapeTech","PWT46TT","Premium Work Trousers - Waist Size 30",27.44,"<p>TapeTech Premium Workwear is the most durable, functional and comfortable clothing in the industry. Designed specifically for drywall finishing professionals, the trousers and shorts help you be more professional, productive and profitable. Constructed of heavy-duty cotton and polyester to prevent shrinking, both the trousers and shorts feature 13 pockets to hold tools and personal items. Reinforced knees and cuffs plus triple stitching provide unmatched durability on the job. Reflective striping and piping on the trousers provide increased visibility and safety on dark jobsites. The elastic waist ensures all-day comfort and flexibility. Lifetime warranty on seams and workmanship. Choose only your waist size when ordering. The length for each waist size is expertly tailored based on average inseam for the waist size. For persons with very long legs, the trousers may fall higher on the work shoes. For persons with short legs, the trousers may fall lower on the work shoes.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Features:</p> <p>Waist Size 30 inches</p> <p>Inseam 30.9 inches</p> <ul> <li>13 pockets</li> <li>7 extra wide belt loops</li> <li>Triple stitching</li> <li>Reflective striping and piping</li> <li>Reinforced knees and cuffs</li> <li>Elastic waist</li> <li>Pockets for kneepads</li> </ul>"
