"TapeTech","SCP001WD","TapeTech 7""X13"" Galvaniz Steel Bucket Scoop",11.2,"<div id=""product-details-information-tab-content-container-0"" class=""product-details-information-tab-content-container"" data-type=""information-content-text"">The TapeTech bucket scoop is perfect to move EIFS, stucco, plaster, mortar and other material from the bucket to your hawk, trowel or mortar board. Crafted from thick, galvanized steel to prevent bending and buckling that some ordinary scoops experience, our bucket scoop features a hanger strap that extends to the bottom of the scoop for added strength. The wood handle is comfortable for all day use.</div> <div class=""product-warning"">&nbsp;</div>"
"TapeTech","SCP02","TapeTech 6.5"" Stainless Steel Bucket Scoop",5.7,"<div class=""sui-flex sui-flex-col sui-gap-2""> <p>The TapeTech 6.5"" Stainless Steel Bucket Scoop is designed to quickly and efficiently remove compound, plaster, EIFS material and stucco from buckets. The curved design fits the wall of the bucket, reducing material waste and making cleaning easier. The stainless steel blade is reinforced with an aluminum backing plate and double-riveted to the handle, ensuring durability and stability. The TapeTech Bucket Scoop is perfect for a variety of applications and materials, including drywall, plaster, EIFS material, stucco, mortar, epoxy, adhesive, thin-set, cement, putty, and more. Features the ergonomic TapeTech ProSoft grip for all-day comfort and reduced fatigue.</p> </div> <div> <p class=""sui-h3-bold sui-line-clamp-unset sui-font-normal sui-text-primary"">Features</p> <ul class=""sui-w-full sui-list-disc sui-px-6 sui-flex sui-flex-col sui-gap-2 sui-mt-2"" data-testid=""bullet-list""> <li data-testid=""bullet-list-item"">The TapeTech 6.5"" Stainless Steel Bucket Scoop is designed to quickly and efficiently remove compound, plaster, EIFS material and stucco from buckets.</li> <li data-testid=""bullet-list-item"">The curved design fits the wall of the bucket, reducing material waste and making cleaning easier.</li> <li data-testid=""bullet-list-item"">The stainless steel blade is reinforced with an aluminum backing plate and double-riveted to the handle, ensuring durability and stability.</li> <li data-testid=""bullet-list-item"">The TapeTech Bucket Scoop is perfect for a variety of applications and materials, including drywall, plaster, EIFS material, stucco, mortar, epoxy, adhesive, thin-set, cement, putty, and more.</li> </ul> </div>"
"TapeTech","T032","TapeTech Gooser Release Cam",3.45,"<p>TapeTech Gooser Release Cam</p>"
"TapeTech","TC01TT","Tool Caddy",37.37,"<p>The Tool Caddy is the&nbsp;perfect accessory for workers who fill their finishing boxes with a compound tube instead of a loading pump. The durable design and construction of the Tool Caddy securely holds any size finishing box in the perfect filling position, even with the handle attached. It conveniently holds any length compound tube and filler adapter, preventing the need to place the tool on the floor or in the bucket of joint compound between fills. The position of the Tool Caddy’s support bracket can be adjusted to securely attach to almost any bucket height and is perfect to rest your finishing boxes even when using a loading pump. The Tool Caddy positions the finishing box securely, preventing the tool from falling or joint compound from leaking.</p>"
"TapeTech","VABS050","TapeTech 2"" Italian ABS Float",9.77,"<div class=""vc_row wpb_row top-row porto-inner-container wpb_custom_034b39d9bc6c6b310d69e39f0ccf274f""> <div class=""porto-wrap-container container""> <div class=""row""> <div class=""product-summary-wrap m-b-lg vc_column_container col-md-7""> <div class=""wpb_wrapper vc_column-inner""> <div class=""wpb_custom_a328554866cc55615e356a5b5c183a1d""> <div id=""product-tab"" class=""woocommerce-tabs woocommerce-tabs-691oyk4z resp-htabs""> <div class=""resp-tabs-container""> <div id=""tab-description"" class=""tab-content resp-tab-content resp-tab-content-active"" aria-labelledby=""tab_item-0""> <p>The TapeTech 2″ x 11″ ABS Float is perfect for achieving optimal results when finishing EIFS, stucco and plaster. The durable yet flexible blade has rounded corners to prevent gouging.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>"
"TapeTech","VABS130","TapeTech 5"" Italian ABS Float",9.77,"<p>The TapeTech 5″ x 11″ ABS Float is perfect for achieving optimal results when finishing EIFS, stucco and plaster. The durable yet flexible blade has rounded corners to prevent gouging.</p>"
"TapeTech","XHTT","TapeTech Extension Handle",122.22,"<p>TapeTech is the first company to introduce an interchangeable handle system that allows one support handle to be used with every tool. Whether you use standard, fixed length fiberglass handles or aluminum extension support handles, you’ll need just one base handle.</p> <p>The base handle for the fiberglass system is model FHTT. The base handle for the extension handle system is model XHTT. The base handle fits the corner roller, corner applicator and nail spotter without any adapters. The heavy duty, easy-to-change adapter (CFA-TT) connects the new handles to the corner finishers, and the new, optimal diameter makes TapeTech handles the most ergonomic in the industry.</p> <p>Both base handles feature a D-shaped fitting that securely positions the handle in the Corner Applicator and positively prevents the tool from rotating during use.</p> <p>Note: If you use your current Nail Spotters with the new handle system you will need to mount the handle in the back holes of the tabs on the Nail Spotter.</p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","030250","USG Sheetrock Acoustical Sealant",8.64,"<u>Features:</u> <ul> <li>Excellent sound-flanking material (Supports high STC ratings)</li> <li>Superior performance as a fire caulk in UL-classified joint systems</li> <li>Ideal for use in smoke and/or sound assemblies</li> <li>Meets ASTM C834 specifications for latex sealants</li> <li>Grade 0 degrees F low temperature flexibility, strong bond</li> <li>Low VOC</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","114CDWS5","USG Sheetrock Tools #6 X 1-1/4"" Textured Head, Coarse Thread Drywall Screw w/ TENZ [5LB]",14.2,"<p>USG Sheetrock Coarse Thread Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board to wood framing. These screws feature an extra sharp point that makes penetrating into wood quick and easy. This screw was designed with TENZ Stair Thread Technology that reduces torque, tool wear, and increases driving speed. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality gray phosphate coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p><strong>TENZ Technology</strong></p> <p>The stairs called ""Stairs of the Peak (SP)"" and ""Stairs of the Vale (SV)"" are located along the thread and the precise shape makes it possible to displace the wood fibers in a gentle way. The interplay between the pair of stairs makes the TENZ Stairs Thread Technology so unique.&nbsp;</p> <p>4 Reasons for TENZ:</p> <ul> <li><strong>MORE POWER WITH ONE BATTERY:</strong> Maximum utilization of the battery power. Set up to twice as many screws with one battery charge.</li> <li><strong>INCREASES TOOL LIFE:</strong> Lower costs, as the service life of the tool is increased up to 10 times.&nbsp;</li> <li><strong>TOP PERFORMANCE - MINIMUM EFFORT:</strong> Up to 50% less resistance reduces the amount of working power required for screwing.</li> <li><strong>PROTECTS WOOD:</strong> With TENZ Stairs the wood fibers are gently displaced instead of being drilled or milled. This effect is unique for TENZ Technology.&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Gray Phosphate Coating</li> <li>Designed for Attaching Gypsum Panels to Wood Studs</li> <li>Hi-Tech Thread Design</li> <li>Extreme Sharp Point-Faster Engagement</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/CoarseThread_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Coarse Thread Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/TENZ_Technology_Handout.pdf"">TENZ Technology (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","114CDWS8M","USG Sheetrock Tools #6 X 1-1/4"" Textured Head, Coarse Thread Drywall Screw w/ TENZ [Bulk]",43.75,"<p>USG Sheetrock Coarse Thread Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board to wood framing. These screws feature an extra sharp point that makes penetrating into wood quick and easy. This screw was designed with TENZ Stair Thread Technology that reduces torque, tool wear, and increases driving speed. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality gray phosphate coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p><strong>TENZ Technology</strong></p> <p>The stairs called ""Stairs of the Peak (SP)"" and ""Stairs of the Vale (SV)"" are located along the thread and the precise shape makes it possible to displace the wood fibers in a gentle way. The interplay between the pair of stairs makes the TENZ Stairs Thread Technology so unique.&nbsp;</p> <p>4 Reasons for TENZ:</p> <ul> <li><strong>MORE POWER WITH ONE BATTERY:</strong> Maximum utilization of the battery power. Set up to twice as many screws with one battery charge.</li> <li><strong>INCREASES TOOL LIFE:</strong> Lower costs, as the service life of the tool is increased up to 10 times.&nbsp;</li> <li><strong>TOP PERFORMANCE - MINIMUM EFFORT:</strong> Up to 50% less resistance reduces the amount of working power required for screwing.</li> <li><strong>PROTECTS WOOD:</strong> With TENZ Stairs the wood fibers are gently displaced instead of being drilled or milled. This effect is unique for TENZ Technology.&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Gray Phosphate Coating</li> <li>Designed for Attaching Gypsum Panels to Wood Studs</li> <li>Hi-Tech Thread Design</li> <li>Extreme Sharp Point-Faster Engagement</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/CoarseThread_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Coarse Thread Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/TENZ_Technology_Handout.pdf"">TENZ Technology (PDF)</a></p>"
