"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340310","USG Sheetrock Tools 90 Degree Outside Corner Paper Face Bead Roller",74.99,"<p>This Outside Drywall Corner Roller is designed with non-slip soft grip wheels for added drywall taping and installation performance on outside 90° corners.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable stainless steel construction</li> <li>Non-slip soft grip wheels</li> <li>Bumpers to prevent corner taping damage</li> <li>Includes 4 foot fiberglass pole</li> </ul>"
