"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340401","10 in USG Sheetrock Tools MATRIX Stainless Steel Mud Pan",27.25,"<p>Matrix Drywall Mud Pans feature a reinforced stainless steel band around the top for added durability. A contoured bottom and the continuous heli-arc weld make mixing and cleaning easier. Matrix Mud Pans are available in three different lengths.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable construction</li> <li>Contoured bottom for easy mixing and cleaning</li> <li>Made with rust-proof stainless steel</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340402","12 in USG Sheetrock Tools MATRIX Stainless Steel Mud Pan",28.74,"<p>Matrix Drywall Mud Pans feature a reinforced stainless steel band around the top for added durability. A contoured bottom and the continuous heli-arc weld make mixing and cleaning easier. Matrix Mud Pans are available in three different lengths.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable construction</li> <li>Contoured bottom for easy mixing and cleaning</li> <li>Made with rust-proof stainless steel</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340403","14 in USG Sheetrock Tools MATRIX Stainless Steel Mud Pan",30.1,"<p>Matrix™ Drywall Mud Pans feature a reinforced stainless steel band around the top for added durability. A contoured bottom and the continuous heli-arc weld make mixing and cleaning easier. Matrix Mud Pans are available in three different lengths.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable stainless steel construction</li> <li>Contoured bottom for easy mixing and cleaning</li> <li>Available in 10"", 12"" and 14"" lengths</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340404","8 in USG Sheetrock Tools Mud Pan Grip",7.69,"<p>Our Professional Mud Pan Grip is the perfect complement to any stainless steel drywall mud pan. The non-slip surface is comfortable and protects hands in both hot and cold environments. The magnetic grip is removable for use on any sized metal drywall mud pan.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Non-slip</li> <li>All weather</li> <li>Fits all sizes of stainless steel mud pans</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340405","10 in USG Sheetrock Tools Classic Stainless Steel Drywall Mud Pan",24.76,"<p>The Classic™ Drywall Mud Pan has a contoured bottom and a continuous heli-arc weld for easy mixing and cleaning. These mud pans are comfortable to work with for all your drywall taping, texturing and finishing jobs.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable construction</li> <li>Contoured bottom for easy mixing and cleaning</li> <li>Made with rust-proof stainless steel</li> <li>Heli-arc welded for a smooth finish</li> <li>Range in length from 10"" to 24""</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340406","12 in USG Sheetrock Tools Classic Stainless Steel Drywall Mud Pan",25.56,"<p>The Classic™ Drywall Mud Pan has a contoured bottom and a continuous heli-arc weld for easy mixing and cleaning. These mud pans are comfortable to work with for all your drywall taping, texturing and finishing jobs.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable construction</li> <li>Contoured bottom for easy mixing and cleaning</li> <li>Made with rust-proof stainless steel</li> <li>Heli-Arc welded for a smooth finish</li> <li>Range in length from 10"" to 24""</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340407","14 in USG Sheetrock Tools Classic Stainless Steel Drywall Mud Pan",26.38,"<p>The Classic™ Drywall Mud Pan has a contoured bottom and a continuous heli-arc weld for easy mixing and cleaning. These mud pans are comfortable to work with for all your drywall taping, texturing and finishing jobs.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable construction</li> <li>Contoured bottom for easy mixing and cleaning</li> <li>Made with rust-proof stainless steel</li> <li>Heli-arc welded for a smooth finish</li> <li>Range in length from 10"" to 24""</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340413","30 in USG Sheetrock Tools Mud Mixer",27.99,"<p>This Professional Drywall Mud Mixer is made of heavy gauge durable steel and provides fast, efficient mixing. Because it is balanced and self-centering, this drywall tool is easy to operate and mixes joint compound up to 20% faster than conventional mixers. The Tri-Fold Mixing Action folds drywall mud material from the sides, top and bottom, resulting in less shaking, less splattering and less mess.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Durable steel construction</li> <li>Balanced and self-centering</li> <li>Minimizes bucket gouge</li> <li>Folds mud compound from sides, top and bottom</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340414","6 in USG Sheetrock Tools Jab Saw",11.29,"<p>Our Professional Drywall Jab Saw is a tool designed to cut drywall more efficiently. The sharp tip excels at plunge cutting, and its aggressive tooth design cuts through sheetrock fast. A light handle provides maximum comfort and hand protection during installation and drywall repair jobs.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Sharp tip for plunge cutting drywall</li> <li>Aggressive saw tooth design</li> <li>Light, soft-grip tool handle for maximum comfort</li> <li>1.8 mm thickness for added strength</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340416","48 in USG Sheetrock Tools Heavy Duty T-Square",19.97,"<p>Our heavy duty T-Square is designed with the professional drywall installer in mind. Has a highly visible green finish and 1/2"" tall finger guard to protect against accidental blade jumps.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Comes in 48"" and 54"" lengths</li> <li>1/2"" tall finger guard protects against blade jumps</li> <li>Easy to read 1/8"" marking</li> <li>Heavy-duty 3/16"" aluminum blade</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340417","54 in USG Sheetrock Tools Heavy Duty T-Square",22.57,"<p>Our heavy duty T-Square is designed with the professional drywall installer in mind. Has a highly visible green finish and 1/2"" tall finger guard to protect against accidental blade jumps. </p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Comes in 48"" and 54"" lengths</li> <li>1/2"" tall finger guard protects against blade jumps</li> <li>Easy to read 1/8"" marking</li> <li>Heavy-duty 3/16"" aluminum blade</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340800","USG Sheetrock Tools The Dimpler Screw Setting Tool [Box of 10]",83.15,"<p>This compact tool converts your standard electric drill into a professional screwgun.</p> <h6><strong>Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Countersinks screws perfectly</li> <li>Prevents stripping screw head</li> <li>Extends bit life</li> <li>Powerful magnet holds screws in place in any drill position</li> <li>Prevents screws from penetrating to far and weakening the gypsum core</li> <li>The&nbsp;USG340800 is a Box of 10 Dimplers</li> </ul>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340925","USG Sheetrock Tools 18""-30"" Professional Magnesium Drywall Stilts",255.82,"<p>These ultra-light MAGNESIUM stilts elevate drywall stilts to a whole new level. Introducing a range of new practical features that improve comfort and ease of use.</p> <p>Built to the high standards you have come to expect from USG Sheetrock Tools.</p> <h6><strong>Primary Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Made with ultra-lightweight MAGNESIUM - 33% lighter than aluminum stilts</li> <li>Padded wrap-around leg straps for superior comfort, durability, and a secure fit <ul> <li>No need for additional comfort products!</li> </ul> </li> <li>Quick-release clamp for fast and easy adjustments WITHOUT the need for any tools</li> <li>Dual adjustable height bolts with easy to use 3-sided knob for quick adjustments</li> <li>Two-piece rubber foot sole for classic balance and mobility</li> <li>235 lb. max load capacity - highest rated in the industry</li> </ul> <h6><strong>Additional Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Fully adjustable 1-1/2"" secure buckle and strap</li> <li>Adjustable heel bracket for a custom fit</li> <li>Self-locking arch and heel foot straps</li> <li>Wide footplate for improved comfort and stability</li> <li>Dual spring action for a natural feel while walking</li> <li>Adjustable height strut tubes for a custom fit</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/USG_Sheetrock_Stilts___TSW_Sales_Sheet___NP.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">TSW Sales and Info Sheet (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/SRT_Stilts_Parts_List_and_Schematic.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">USG SRT Stilts Parts List and Schematic (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/USG_Sheetrock_Tools___Stilts_Spec_Sheet.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">USG Sheetrock Tools Professional Drywall Stilts Spec Sheet (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","340926","USG Sheetrock Tools 24""-40"" Professional Magnesium Drywall Stilts",263.68,"<p>These ultra-light MAGNESIUM stilts elevate drywall stilts to a whole new level. Introducing a range of new practical features that improve comfort and ease of use.</p> <p>Built to the high standards you have come to expect from USG Sheetrock Tools.</p> <h6><strong>Primary Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Made with ultra-lightweight MAGNESIUM - 33% lighter than aluminum stilts</li> <li>Padded wrap-around leg straps for superior comfort, durability, and a secure fit <ul> <li>No need for additional comfort products!</li> </ul> </li> <li>Quick-release clamp for fast and easy adjustments WITHOUT the need for any tools</li> <li>Dual adjustable height bolts with easy to use 3-sided knob for quick adjustments</li> <li>Two-piece rubber foot sole for classic balance and mobility</li> <li>235 lb. max load capacity - highest rated in the industry</li> </ul> <h6><strong>Additional Features</strong></h6> <ul> <li>Fully adjustable 1-1/2"" secure buckle and strap</li> <li>Adjustable heel bracket for a custom fit</li> <li>Self-locking arch and heel foot straps</li> <li>Wide footplate for improved comfort and stability</li> <li>Dual spring action for a natural feel while walking</li> <li>Adjustable height strut tubes for a custom fit</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/USG_Sheetrock_Stilts___TSW_Sales_Sheet___NP.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">TSW Sales and Info Sheet (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/SRT_Stilts_Parts_List_and_Schematic.pdf"">USG SRT Stilts Parts List and Schematic (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/USG_Sheetrock_Tools___Stilts_Spec_Sheet.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">USG Sheetrock Tools Professional Drywall Stilts Spec Sheet (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","3CDWS2M","USG Sheetrock Tools #8 X 3"" Textured Head, Coarse Thread Drywall Screw w/ TENZ [Bulk]",27.95,"<p>USG Sheetrock Coarse Thread Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board to wood framing. These screws feature an extra sharp point that makes penetrating into wood quick and easy. This screw was designed with TENZ Stair Thread Technology that reduces torque, tool wear, and increases driving speed. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality gray phosphate coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p><strong>TENZ Technology</strong></p> <p>The stairs called ""Stairs of the Peak (SP)"" and ""Stairs of the Vale (SV)"" are located along the thread and the precise shape makes it possible to displace the wood fibers in a gentle way. The interplay between the pair of stairs makes the TENZ Stairs Thread Technology so unique.&nbsp;</p> <p>4 Reasons for TENZ:</p> <ul> <li><strong>MORE POWER WITH ONE BATTERY:</strong> Maximum utilization of the battery power. Set up to twice as many screws with one battery charge.</li> <li><strong>INCREASES TOOL LIFE:</strong> Lower costs, as the service life of the tool is increased up to 10 times.&nbsp;</li> <li><strong>TOP PERFORMANCE - MINIMUM EFFORT:</strong> Up to 50% less resistance reduces the amount of working power required for screwing.</li> <li><strong>PROTECTS WOOD:</strong> With TENZ Stairs the wood fibers are gently displaced instead of being drilled or milled. This effect is unique for TENZ Technology.&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Gray Phosphate Coating</li> <li>Designed for Attaching Gypsum Panels to Wood Studs</li> <li>Hi-Tech Thread Design</li> <li>Extreme Sharp Point-Faster Engagement</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/CoarseThread_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Coarse Thread Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/TENZ_Technology_Handout.pdf"">TENZ Technology (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","3CDWS5","USG Sheetrock 8 X 3"" Textured Head, Coarse Thread Drywall Screw w/ TENZ [5lbs]",14.54,"<p>USG Sheetrock Coarse Thread Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board to wood framing. These screws feature an extra sharp point that makes penetrating into wood quick and easy. This screw was designed with TENZ Stair Thread Technology that reduces torque, tool wear, and increases driving speed. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality gray phosphate coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p><strong>TENZ Technology</strong></p> <p>The stairs called ""Stairs of the Peak (SP)"" and ""Stairs of the Vale (SV)"" are located along the thread and the precise shape makes it possible to displace the wood fibers in a gentle way. The interplay between the pair of stairs makes the TENZ Stairs Thread Technology so unique.&nbsp;</p> <p>4 Reasons for TENZ:</p> <ul> <li><strong>MORE POWER WITH ONE BATTERY:</strong> Maximum utilization of the battery power. Set up to twice as many screws with one battery charge.</li> <li><strong>INCREASES TOOL LIFE:</strong> Lower costs, as the service life of the tool is increased up to 10 times.&nbsp;</li> <li><strong>TOP PERFORMANCE - MINIMUM EFFORT:</strong> Up to 50% less resistance reduces the amount of working power required for screwing.</li> <li><strong>PROTECTS WOOD:</strong> With TENZ Stairs the wood fibers are gently displaced instead of being drilled or milled. This effect is unique for TENZ Technology.&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Gray Phosphate Coating</li> <li>Designed for Attaching Gypsum Panels to Wood Studs</li> <li>Hi-Tech Thread Design</li> <li>Extreme Sharp Point-Faster Engagement</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/CoarseThread_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Coarse Thread Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/TENZ_Technology_Handout.pdf"">TENZ Technology (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","3FDWS2M","USG Sheetrock Tools 8 X 3"" Textured Head, Fine Thread Drywall Screw [Bulk]",27.95,"<p>USG Sheetrock Fine Thread Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board to wood or light gauge steel framing. These screws feature an extreme sharp point that make penetrating into wood or 20-25 gauge metal studs quick and easy. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality gray phosphate coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Phosphate Coating</li> <li>Ideal for Metal&nbsp;Studs</li> <li>Fine Thread</li> <li>Extreme Sharp Point Faster Engagement</li> </ul> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/FineThread_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Fine Thread Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","3FDWS5","USG Sheetrock Tools #8 X 3"" Textured Head, Fine Thread Drywall Screw [5LB]",14.54,"<p>USG Sheetrock Fine Thread Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board to wood or light gauge steel framing. These screws feature an extreme sharp point that make penetrating into wood or 20-25 gauge metal studs quick and easy. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality gray phosphate coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Phosphate Coating</li> <li>Ideal for Metal&nbsp;Studs</li> <li>Fine Thread</li> <li>Extreme Sharp Point Faster Engagement</li> </ul> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/FineThread_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Fine Thread Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p>"
"USG Sheetrock® Tools","3SDSZ2M","USG Sheetrock Tools #8 X 3"" Textured Bugle Head, Self Drill Drywall Screw [Bulk]",63.79,"<p>USG Sheetrock Bugle Head Self Drill Drywall Screws are utilized in the installation of gypsum board or light gauge steel framing. These screws feature an extra sharp point that makes penetrating into wood or light gauge metal studs quick and easy. The revolutionary design of the #2 Phillips head features a textured surface for better mud adhesion during finishing. The screw also has a high-quality&nbsp;zinc coating finish that easily blends with your mudding and paint for interior applications.</p> <p>Features:</p> <ul> <li>Textured Head For Better Mud Adhesion</li> <li>Zinc Coating</li> <li>Ideal For Metal Studs</li> <li><strong>Self Drill:</strong> Designed for Attaching Gypsum Panels to Light Gauge Metal Studs</li> <li>Self Drill Point</li> </ul> <p><a href=""https://s3.amazonaws.com/tswfastcomfiles/category/SelfDrill_SellSheet_3.pdf"">Self Drill Drywall Screw Sell Sheet (PDF)</a></p>"
